    "subtitles": {
      "name": "Whiplash.2014.en.srt",
      "cues": [
        {
          "s": 92,
          "e": 93.8,
          "t": "Sorry... I’m -- I’m sorry--"
        },
        {
          "s": 96.23,
          "e": 97.56,
          "t": "It’s ok. Stay there."
        },
        {
          "s": 98.41,
          "e": 99.68,
          "t": "- What’s your name?"
        },
        {
          "s": 105.97,
          "e": 107.57,
          "t": "JIM: Andrew Neiman, sir."
        },
        {
          "s": 114.66,
          "e": 115.86,
          "t": "You know who I am?"
        },
        {
          "s": 120.33,
          "e": 121.43,
          "t": "Yes..."
        },
        {
          "s": 127.14,
          "e": 128.74,
          "t": "[INDISTINCT CHATTER]"
        },
        {
          "s": 129.54,
          "e": 130.8,
          "t": "You know what I do?"
        },
        {
          "s": 133.87,
          "e": 135.07,
          "t": "- Pink (9/10/2013)"
        },
        {
          "s": 140.78,
          "e": 141.88,
          "t": "Yes..."
        },
        {
          "s": 145.27,
          "e": 147.8,
          "t": "- So you know I’m looking for players."
        },
        {
          "s": 149.27,
          "e": 150.37,
          "t": "Yes..."
        },
        {
          "s": 152.49,
          "e": 154.09,
          "t": "[INDISTINCT CHATTER]"
        },
        {
          "s": 154.89,
          "e": 156.89,
          "t": "Then why did you stop playing?"
        },
        {
          "s": 158.35,
          "e": 160.55,
          "t": "Did I say to start playing again?"
        },
        {
          "s": 163.15,
          "e": 164.25,
          "t": "I thought--"
        },
        {
          "s": 169.3,
          "e": 170.63,
          "t": "I’m sorry, I misun--"
        },
        {
          "s": 173.83,
          "e": 176.56,
          "t": "I asked you why you stopped playing. Your"
        },
        {
          "s": 177.25,
          "e": 179.85,
          "t": "version of an answer was to turn into a"
        },
        {
          "s": 180.31,
          "e": 181.84,
          "t": "wind-up drummer monkey."
        },
        {
          "s": 186.01,
          "e": 188.74,
          "t": "I’m sorry -- I--I stopped playing becau--"
        },
        {
          "s": 191.87,
          "e": 193.8,
          "t": "CARL: Show me your rudiments."
        },
        {
          "s": 202.18,
          "e": 204.85,
          "t": "No. Double-time. Double it. Bop-bop-bop-"
        },
        {
          "s": 205.37,
          "e": 207.24,
          "t": "bop-bop-bop-bop-bop-bop-bop."
        },
        {
          "s": 209.78,
          "e": 212.18,
          "t": "<i>Woopsy-daisy. Forgot my coat.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 214.75,
          "e": 216.35,
          "t": "[INDISTINCT CHATTER]"
        },
        {
          "s": 217.15,
          "e": 218.25,
          "t": "Swedish fish?"
        },
        {
          "s": 219.91,
          "e": 221.85,
          "t": "Nah, not this time, thanks..."
        },
        {
          "s": 222.49,
          "e": 223.59,
          "t": "You ok?"
        },
        {
          "s": 226.84,
          "e": 227.98,
          "t": "FLETCHER: Sure..."
        },
        {
          "s": 230.39,
          "e": 231.79,
          "t": "He had me play today."
        },
        {
          "s": 233.12,
          "e": 234.22,
          "t": "JIM: And?"
        },
        {
          "s": 238.04,
          "e": 240.1,
          "t": "- You still have other options."
        },
        {
          "s": 242.58,
          "e": 243.72,
          "t": "What do you mean?"
        },
        {
          "s": 247.55,
          "e": 250.15,
          "t": "It’s good to be open-minded. When I was"
        },
        {
          "s": 250.64,
          "e": 253.44,
          "t": "your age I thought I’d have a book deal at"
        },
        {
          "s": 253.8,
          "e": 256.26,
          "t": "23. Then that changed to 30. Then 40."
        },
        {
          "s": 264.72,
          "e": 267.25,
          "t": "I mean, it has to do something to you."
        },
        {
          "s": 272.7,
          "e": 275.37,
          "t": "CARL: I don’t know. Why? It’s just life."
        },
        {
          "s": 278.24,
          "e": 280.58,
          "t": "There’s other things to care about."
        },
        {
          "s": 280.97,
          "e": 282.23,
          "t": "Friends. Romance..."
        },
        {
          "s": 285.76,
          "e": 288.43,
          "t": "FLETCHER: At my age you get perspective."
        },
        {
          "s": 293.52,
          "e": 295.72,
          "t": "NICOLE: I don’t want perspective."
        },
        {
          "s": 297.28,
          "e": 298.38,
          "t": "Pink (9/10/2013)"
        },
        {
          "s": 301.83,
          "e": 302.93,
          "t": "Sorry."
        },
        {
          "s": 308.48,
          "e": 311.08,
          "t": "By the age of ten, Traps the Boy Wonder"
        },
        {
          "s": 311.64,
          "e": 314.44,
          "t": "was wowing crowds all over America. By his"
        },
        {
          "s": 315.24,
          "e": 318.38,
          "t": "<i>teens, Buddy Rich was well on his way to</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 318.95,
          "e": 320.88,
          "t": "becoming the stuff of legend."
        },
        {
          "s": 326.34,
          "e": 329.08,
          "t": "Like any truly great player, Buddy seemed"
        },
        {
          "s": 329.65,
          "e": 332.45,
          "t": "to have been born with music in his blood."
        },
        {
          "s": 332.82,
          "e": 335.55,
          "t": "- He grasped it intuitively, in a way you"
        },
        {
          "s": 336.33,
          "e": 338.06,
          "t": "- <i>and I just can’t.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 339.36,
          "e": 342.16,
          "t": "You check out the old stuff, man. You look"
        },
        {
          "s": 342.98,
          "e": 345.98,
          "t": "<i>at those movies when he was a kid, his</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 346.44,
          "e": 347.54,
          "t": "arms..."
        },
        {
          "s": 348.2,
          "e": 349.8,
          "t": "- You just that. That of"
        },
        {
          "s": 350.26,
          "e": 351.36,
          "t": "- genius."
        },
        {
          "s": 356.14,
          "e": 358.61,
          "t": "CARL: You either got it or you don’t."
        },
        {
          "s": 361.6,
          "e": 363.8,
          "t": "My man Ry! Shit, how you feeling?"
        },
        {
          "s": 366.66,
          "e": 368,
          "t": "Stitched up at last,"
        },
        {
          "s": 373.61,
          "e": 376.14,
          "t": "Things were hurting with Neiman on the"
        },
        {
          "s": 376.66,
          "e": 377.76,
          "t": "kit--"
        },
        {
          "s": 381.7,
          "e": 384.1,
          "t": "<i>You have a good weekend, bro?</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 387.34,
          "e": 389.34,
          "t": "Yeah. Definitely. Really good."
        },
        {
          "s": 394.25,
          "e": 395.58,
          "t": "You been practicing?"
        },
        {
          "s": 399.53,
          "e": 401.26,
          "t": "<i>Yeah. All the time.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 403.26,
          "e": 404.36,
          "t": "My man."
        },
        {
          "s": 407.5,
          "e": 409.97,
          "t": "<i>Morning, “Billie’s In”, bar 8.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 410.91,
          "e": 412.97,
          "t": "<i>ANDREW: Pink (9/10/2013)</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 419.47,
          "e": 421.67,
          "t": "Ryan... Woah, trumpets. TRUMPETER"
        },
        {
          "s": 422.29,
          "e": 425.42,
          "t": "<i>** Yeah, yeah - sorry about that one. **</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 426.11,
          "e": 428.37,
          "t": "MR. KRAMER ** Just brass again. **"
        },
        {
          "s": 432.42,
          "e": 433.52,
          "t": "NICOLE: Ry..."
        },
        {
          "s": 435.37,
          "e": 436.47,
          "t": "Not today."
        },
        {
          "s": 441.26,
          "e": 443.92,
          "t": "<i>CARL: Are you learning from Ryan?</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 448.51,
          "e": 451.31,
          "t": "FLETCHER: Last was little overwhelming for"
        },
        {
          "s": 451.81,
          "e": 452.91,
          "t": "- you?"
        },
        {
          "s": 457.48,
          "e": 458.58,
          "t": "- Yeah..."
        },
        {
          "s": 459.27,
          "e": 461.53,
          "t": "I wonder...what you think about my"
        },
        {
          "s": 461.99,
          "e": 463.09,
          "t": "progress?"
        },
        {
          "s": 468.45,
          "e": 470.05,
          "t": "[DRUMS POUNDING]"
        },
        {
          "s": 474.85,
          "e": 476.12,
          "t": "Pink (9/10/2013) 8A"
        },
        {
          "s": 482.16,
          "e": 485.42,
          "t": "NICOLE: Andrew -- you’ve got a good attitude. You"
        },
        {
          "s": 486.22,
          "e": 488.15,
          "t": "<i>always arrive on time.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 490.87,
          "e": 491.97,
          "t": "- Yeah. Ok?"
        },
        {
          "s": 495.45,
          "e": 498.05,
          "t": "Ok... Do you think... I know Fletcher’s"
        },
        {
          "s": 498.82,
          "e": 501.49,
          "t": "looking for players...for Studio Band..."
        },
        {
          "s": 507.53,
          "e": 510.33,
          "t": "- Yeah, Andrew... Lincoln Center looks out"
        },
        {
          "s": 510.91,
          "e": 513.64,
          "t": "for Fletcher’s top players. If it weren’t"
        },
        {
          "s": 514.34,
          "e": 517.14,
          "t": "for Ryan’s injury he’d have been in Studio"
        },
        {
          "s": 517.51,
          "e": 520.05,
          "t": "Band last year. He’s a natural player."
        },
        {
          "s": 522.8,
          "e": 525.6,
          "t": "Look... I’m going to be candid. 90% of our"
        },
        {
          "s": 526.26,
          "e": 529.06,
          "t": "<i>players will never make it into the</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 529.91,
          "e": 532.51,
          "t": "Lincoln Centers or the Collectives. The"
        },
        {
          "s": 533.12,
          "e": 535.32,
          "t": "question is -- who’s in that 10%?"
        },
        {
          "s": 537.53,
          "e": 540.13,
          "t": "So I’d practice. You could start a rock"
        },
        {
          "s": 540.6,
          "e": 541.7,
          "t": "band."
        },
        {
          "s": 545.25,
          "e": 547.78,
          "t": "<i>I...I have one more question...</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 551.95,
          "e": 554.29,
          "t": "...Do you know what the process for"
        },
        {
          "s": 554.69,
          "e": 555.79,
          "t": "transferring is?"
        },
        {
          "s": 560.68,
          "e": 563.28,
          "t": "Hey -- look -- I -- I don’t know how to"
        },
        {
          "s": 564.05,
          "e": 566.85,
          "t": "say this -- I see you in here all the time"
        },
        {
          "s": 567.27,
          "e": 569.27,
          "t": "and -- I was just wondering --"
        },
        {
          "s": 573.22,
          "e": 576.02,
          "t": "-- if you’d want to get a bite to eat with"
        },
        {
          "s": 576.48,
          "e": 577.58,
          "t": "me."
        },
        {
          "s": 578.8,
          "e": 580.4,
          "t": "[INDISTINCT CHATTER]"
        },
        {
          "s": 586.5,
          "e": 589.04,
          "t": "That your dad you always come in with?"
        },
        {
          "s": 592.37,
          "e": 594.97,
          "t": "Kind of bobs up and down when he walks?"
        },
        {
          "s": 595.68,
          "e": 596.88,
          "t": "<i>That’s him.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 598.58,
          "e": 600.45,
          "t": "- Andrew, right? I’m Nicole."
        },
        {
          "s": 601.97,
          "e": 604.3,
          "t": "ANDREW: Nice to meet you, Nicole..."
        },
        {
          "s": 608.58,
          "e": 609.68,
          "t": "Pink (9/10/2013)"
        },
        {
          "s": 611.64,
          "e": 613.84,
          "t": "<i>Monday I get off at seven.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 614.6,
          "e": 617.2,
          "t": "Monday. Ok. Great. I’ll be here Monday."
        },
        {
          "s": 623.59,
          "e": 625.05,
          "t": "- CARL: Andrew Neiman?"
        },
        {
          "s": 628.85,
          "e": 631.18,
          "t": "Dr. Fletcher would like to see you."
        },
        {
          "s": 635.18,
          "e": 636.44,
          "t": "FLETCHER: Oh. Ok..."
        },
        {
          "s": 640.78,
          "e": 643.78,
          "t": "<i>Hey, Andrew! I guess Sophie found you?</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 645.77,
          "e": 646.9,
          "t": "Yes... I’m... I--"
        },
        {
          "s": 652.24,
          "e": 654.57,
          "t": "Come in, come in, close the door..."
        },
        {
          "s": 656.82,
          "e": 660.29,
          "t": "FLETCHER: I like to chat with students coming in and"
        },
        {
          "s": 660.85,
          "e": 663.18,
          "t": "going out. I hear you’re going out?"
        },
        {
          "s": 665.07,
          "e": 667.14,
          "t": "Yes. Transferring. To Columbia."
        },
        {
          "s": 669.19,
          "e": 671.79,
          "t": "Terrific. Columbia’s a terrific school."
        },
        {
          "s": 672.6,
          "e": 674.66,
          "t": "Did something precipitate this?"
        },
        {
          "s": 679.11,
          "e": 680.44,
          "t": "I just decided to..."
        },
        {
          "s": 683.1,
          "e": 685.63,
          "t": "...to try out some other things. focus"
        },
        {
          "s": 686.06,
          "e": 688.12,
          "t": "<i>only on drums. You know?</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 691.51,
          "e": 692.61,
          "t": "Bravo."
        },
        {
          "s": 697.59,
          "e": 700.59,
          "t": "NICOLE: Too many students clamp down on their"
        },
        {
          "s": 701.19,
          "e": 702.79,
          "t": "“pursuits” like leeches."
        },
        {
          "s": 707.51,
          "e": 709.84,
          "t": "Hobbies they up in their teens, and"
        },
        {
          "s": 710.42,
          "e": 711.88,
          "t": "for what? Take a seat."
        },
        {
          "s": 712.5,
          "e": 714.17,
          "t": "Uh... Yeah.. I mean, I --"
        },
        {
          "s": 717.52,
          "e": 720.12,
          "t": "-- I was a little younger than my teens"
        },
        {
          "s": 720.88,
          "e": 722.68,
          "t": "when I started drums, but--"
        },
        {
          "s": 726.31,
          "e": 728.78,
          "t": "FLETCHER: What were you then? Twelve?"
        },
        {
          "s": 733.33,
          "e": 734.43,
          "t": "- Six."
        },
        {
          "s": 739.53,
          "e": 742.33,
          "t": "Oh. Well, kids start swimming when they’re"
        },
        {
          "s": 742.91,
          "e": 745.64,
          "t": "six, doesn’t mean they’re Michael Phelps."
        },
        {
          "s": 746.37,
          "e": 749.1,
          "t": "It’s a hobby, never anything you consider"
        },
        {
          "s": 749.91,
          "e": 752.25,
          "t": "going all the way with. Am I right?"
        },
        {
          "s": 756.84,
          "e": 759.24,
          "t": "Definitely. I mean -- -- for a time,"
        },
        {
          "s": 759.78,
          "e": 762.18,
          "t": "I thought I’d go all the way -- but,"
        },
        {
          "s": 762.94,
          "e": 764.04,
          "t": "yeah--"
        },
        {
          "s": 768.26,
          "e": 769.36,
          "t": "Pink (9/10/2013)"
        },
        {
          "s": 771.24,
          "e": 774.5,
          "t": "<i>Well, kids want anything. I wanted to be a</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 775.33,
          "e": 778.13,
          "t": "nanny. Thank God those I trusted talked me"
        },
        {
          "s": 778.5,
          "e": 780.63,
          "t": "of it. Good to listen to advice."
        },
        {
          "s": 784.15,
          "e": 786.88,
          "t": "Yes, I’ve done that, you’re right, it’s--"
        },
        {
          "s": 789.89,
          "e": 792.42,
          "t": "--good to get outside perspectives. So"
        },
        {
          "s": 792.88,
          "e": 795.61,
          "t": "long as they don’t have ulterior motives,"
        },
        {
          "s": 796.08,
          "e": 798.41,
          "t": "I’d listen to what the people trust"
        },
        {
          "s": 798.88,
          "e": 799.98,
          "t": "tell you."
        },
        {
          "s": 803.03,
          "e": 805.7,
          "t": "- So what’s the passion you’ve chosen to"
        },
        {
          "s": 806.46,
          "e": 808.26,
          "t": "- pursue at Columbia, then?"
        },
        {
          "s": 809.12,
          "e": 811.92,
          "t": "- Oh... Well... I’m not...not really sure."
        },
        {
          "s": 812.64,
          "e": 815.38,
          "t": "It’s not a specific thing I have in mind."
        },
        {
          "s": 819.06,
          "e": 821.59,
          "t": "Ah. Well that’s ok. You’re young. Most"
        },
        {
          "s": 822.06,
          "e": 824.66,
          "t": "people, it takes years for them to find"
        },
        {
          "s": 825.37,
          "e": 828.11,
          "t": "their calling. My father, for instance --"
        },
        {
          "s": 828.57,
          "e": 831.37,
          "t": "he had no idea what he wanted at your age."
        },
        {
          "s": 832.01,
          "e": 834.75,
          "t": "He tried a lot of things, a little bit of"
        },
        {
          "s": 835.5,
          "e": 838.3,
          "t": "this, a little bit of that. Took him years"
        },
        {
          "s": 838.82,
          "e": 840.95,
          "t": "before he realized his dream was"
        },
        {
          "s": 841.45,
          "e": 843.85,
          "t": "insurance. That was his passion. The"
        },
        {
          "s": 844.28,
          "e": 847.02,
          "t": "cubicle, the coffee breaks, the dry wall."
        },
        {
          "s": 849.25,
          "e": 850.85,
          "t": "[DRUMS POUNDING]"
        },
        {
          "s": 851.65,
          "e": 853.79,
          "t": "sure you’ll find your calling as"
        },
        {
