          "t": "<i>You have nothing to gain from Fletcher</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6255.94,
          "e": 6257.04,
          "t": "- anymore."
        },
        {
          "s": 6263.07,
          "e": 6264.61,
          "t": "Why did you do this...?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6265.78,
          "e": 6269.04,
          "t": "FLETCHER: You think I was going to let him put my"
        },
        {
          "s": 6269.88,
          "e": 6272.55,
          "t": "son through hell and walk off scot-free?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6278.08,
          "e": 6280.55,
          "t": "Don’t you know I would never let that"
        },
        {
          "s": 6281.25,
          "e": 6283.85,
          "t": "happen, Andrew? That there’s nothing in"
        },
        {
          "s": 6284.22,
          "e": 6286.62,
          "t": "world more important to me than you?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6287.42,
          "e": 6288.76,
          "t": "Don’t you know that?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6292.86,
          "e": 6293.96,
          "t": "CARL: ...Andrew?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6297.4,
          "e": 6300.13,
          "t": "ANDREW: Just tell me what to say. WE FADE"
        },
        {
          "s": 6307.04,
          "e": 6308.5,
          "t": "Hey, buddy. You ready?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6316.3,
          "e": 6318.1,
          "t": "- ...I’d rather do it here."
        },
        {
          "s": 6322.7,
          "e": 6325.3,
          "t": "Ok. I stacked your pantry with Gushers."
        },
        {
          "s": 6329.27,
          "e": 6330.37,
          "t": "Thanks, Dad..."
        },
        {
          "s": 6334.44,
          "e": 6336.97,
          "t": "That was Terence Fletcher, the keys..."
        },
        {
          "s": 6340.91,
          "e": 6342.01,
          "t": "Neiman."
        },
        {
          "s": 6346.72,
          "e": 6347.82,
          "t": "...Hi..."
        },
        {
          "s": 6355.49,
          "e": 6357.09,
          "t": "<i>...Oh, just...you</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6357.74,
          "e": 6359.94,
          "t": "<i>know...various...things...</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6360.8,
          "e": 6363.2,
          "t": "...I--I’m sorry about what happened."
        },
        {
          "s": 6367.59,
          "e": 6368.69,
          "t": "At Dunellen."
        },
        {
          "s": 6371.77,
          "e": 6374.3,
          "t": "You shouldn’t be. A player’s got to be"
        },
        {
          "s": 6374.96,
          "e": 6376.23,
          "t": "- willing to fight."
        },
        {
          "s": 6380.54,
          "e": 6382.94,
          "t": "You played with a broken bone. After"
        },
        {
          "s": 6383.65,
          "e": 6385.65,
          "t": "crashing a car. That’s insane."
        },
        {
          "s": 6388.72,
          "e": 6390.66,
          "t": "- I was in a different place."
        },
        {
          "s": 6392.88,
          "e": 6395.21,
          "t": "Good thing you’re not in that place"
        },
        {
          "s": 6395.58,
          "e": 6396.68,
          "t": "anymore."
        },
        {
          "s": 6401.33,
          "e": 6403.73,
          "t": "Have you ever noticed it’s never the"
        },
        {
          "s": 6404.49,
          "e": 6406.76,
          "t": "people with rhythm who clap along?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6409.1,
          "e": 6411.97,
          "t": "- I don’t know if you know... I don’t teach"
        },
        {
          "s": 6412.75,
          "e": 6413.85,
          "t": "anymore."
        },
        {
          "s": 6419.94,
          "e": 6422.34,
          "t": "I... I heard about that... You quit?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6427.98,
          "e": 6429.25,
          "t": "...No, not exactly."
        },
        {
          "s": 6433.29,
          "e": 6435.69,
          "t": "A couple parents got a kid from Sean"
        },
        {
          "s": 6436.24,
          "e": 6438.98,
          "t": "Casey’s year... I don’t know who, I think"
        },
        {
          "s": 6439.77,
          "e": 6442.44,
          "t": "maybe a bassist... They got him to say a"
        },
        {
          "s": 6443.27,
          "e": 6446.07,
          "t": "few things about me... That much I know..."
        },
        {
          "s": 6449.08,
          "e": 6451.15,
          "t": "Though why anyone have anything"
        },
        {
          "s": 6451.54,
          "e": 6453.94,
          "t": "honey and sugar to say about me is a"
        },
        {
          "s": 6454.7,
          "e": 6455.8,
          "t": "mystery."
        },
        {
          "s": 6461.91,
          "e": 6463.11,
          "t": "That’s a good huh?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6464.31,
          "e": 6465.78,
          "t": "Oh, no... I...I just--"
        },
        {
          "s": 6469.95,
          "e": 6472.48,
          "t": "FLETCHER: No, it’s -- I know I’ve made"
        },
        {
          "s": 6472.85,
          "e": 6475.65,
          "t": "enemies. Maybe I seem to think my style is"
        },
        {
          "s": 6476.07,
          "e": 6478.2,
          "t": "normal, but believe me, I don’t."
        },
        {
          "s": 6482.62,
          "e": 6485.02,
          "t": "I’m conducting some, though. They’re"
        },
        {
          "s": 6485.66,
          "e": 6488.4,
          "t": "bringing back the JVC Fest this year, got"
        },
        {
          "s": 6489.23,
          "e": 6491.89,
          "t": "me opening with a pro band in two weeks."
        },
        {
          "s": 6497.43,
          "e": 6498.53,
          "t": "That’s amazing."
        },
        {
          "s": 6504.02,
          "e": 6505.62,
          "t": "[DRUMS POUNDING]"
        },
        {
          "s": 6506.42,
          "e": 6507.52,
          "t": "It’s ok..."
        },
        {
          "s": 6511.56,
          "e": 6514.43,
          "t": "- ANDREW: The truth is I don’t think people"
        },
        {
          "s": 6514.85,
          "e": 6517.58,
          "t": "understand what it is I did at Shaffer. I"
        },
        {
          "s": 6518.33,
          "e": 6520.87,
          "t": "wasn’t there to conduct. Any idiot can"
        },
        {
          "s": 6521.53,
          "e": 6524.2,
          "t": "move his hands and keep people in tempo."
        },
        {
          "s": 6524.88,
          "e": 6527.28,
          "t": "No, it’s about pushing people beyond"
        },
        {
          "s": 6527.7,
          "e": 6529.83,
          "t": "what’s expected of And I believe"
        },
        {
          "s": 6530.31,
          "e": 6532.91,
          "t": "that is a necessity. Because without it"
        },
        {
          "s": 6533.48,
          "e": 6536.01,
          "t": "you’re depriving the world of its next"
        },
        {
          "s": 6536.6,
          "e": 6538.4,
          "t": "Armstrong. Its next Parker."
        },
        {
          "s": 6542.6,
          "e": 6545.73,
          "t": "FLETCHER: Why did Charlie Parker become Charlie"
        },
        {
          "s": 6546.46,
          "e": 6547.56,
          "t": "Parker, Andrew?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6550.65,
          "e": 6552.71,
          "t": "<i>NICOLE: Pink (9/10/2013)</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6557.68,
          "e": 6560.28,
          "t": "Because Jo Jones threw a cymbal at him."
        },
        {
          "s": 6563.13,
          "e": 6565.47,
          "t": "- Exactly. Young pretty good on the"
        },
        {
          "s": 6566.18,
          "e": 6568.98,
          "t": "sax, goes up to play his solo in a cutting"
        },
        {
          "s": 6569.64,
          "e": 6572.38,
          "t": "session, fucks up -- and Jones comes this"
        },
        {
          "s": 6572.89,
          "e": 6576.16,
          "t": "<i>close to slicing his head off for it. He’s</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6576.91,
          "e": 6579.64,
          "t": "laughed off-stage. Cries himself to sleep"
        },
        {
          "s": 6580.3,
          "e": 6582.83,
          "t": "that night. But the next morning, what"
        },
        {
          "s": 6583.63,
          "e": 6586.36,
          "t": "- does he do? He practices. And practices"
        },
        {
          "s": 6586.83,
          "e": 6589.76,
          "t": "- and practices. With one goal in mind: that"
        },
        {
          "s": 6590.45,
          "e": 6593.31,
          "t": "- he never ever be laughed off-stage again."
        },
        {
          "s": 6593.78,
          "e": 6596.58,
          "t": "A year later he goes back to the Reno, and"
        },
        {
          "s": 6597.21,
          "e": 6598.81,
          "t": "<i>he plays solo the</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6599.59,
          "e": 6600.99,
          "t": "world had ever heard."
        },
        {
          "s": 6601.64,
          "e": 6603.24,
          "t": "[DOOR SLAMS]"
        },
        {
          "s": 6604.04,
          "e": 6606.84,
          "t": "Now imagine if Jones had just patted young"
        },
        {
          "s": 6607.26,
          "e": 6609.93,
          "t": "Charlie on the head and said “Good job.”"
        },
        {
          "s": 6610.55,
          "e": 6613.21,
          "t": "Charlie would’ve said to himself, “Well,"
        },
        {
          "s": 6613.88,
          "e": 6616.15,
          "t": "shit, I did do a good job,” and be"
        },
        {
          "s": 6616.64,
          "e": 6619.11,
          "t": "that. No Bird. Tragedy, right? Except"
        },
        {
          "s": 6619.5,
          "e": 6622.1,
          "t": "that’s just what people today want. The"
        },
        {
          "s": 6622.48,
          "e": 6624.41,
          "t": "Shaffer Conservatories of the"
        },
        {
          "s": 6625.19,
          "e": 6628.26,
          "t": "<i>want sugar. You don’t even say “cutting</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6629.06,
          "e": 6631.86,
          "t": "session” anymore, do you? No, you say “jam"
        },
        {
          "s": 6632.37,
          "e": 6635.44,
          "t": "<i>session”. What the fuck kind of word is</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6636.12,
          "e": 6638.92,
          "t": "that? Jam session? It’s a cutting session,"
        },
        {
          "s": 6639.65,
          "e": 6642.45,
          "t": "Andrew, this isn’t fucking Smucker’s. It’s"
        },
        {
          "s": 6643.14,
          "e": 6645.87,
          "t": "about weeding out the best from the worst"
        },
        {
          "s": 6646.56,
          "e": 6649.23,
          "t": "so that the worst become better than the"
        },
        {
          "s": 6650.05,
          "e": 6651.15,
          "t": "best."
        },
        {
          "s": 6654.32,
          "e": 6656.98,
          "t": "I mean look around you. $25 drinks, mood"
        },
        {
          "s": 6657.43,
          "e": 6660.09,
          "t": "lighting, a little shrimp cocktail to go"
        },
        {
          "s": 6660.51,
          "e": 6663.24,
          "t": "with your Coltrane. And people wonder why"
        },
        {
          "s": 6664.09,
          "e": 6665.19,
          "t": "jazz is dying."
        },
        {
          "s": 6668.5,
          "e": 6671.23,
          "t": "Take it from me, and every Starbucks jazz"
        },
        {
          "s": 6671.68,
          "e": 6674.48,
          "t": "- album only proves my point. There are no"
        },
        {
          "s": 6675.3,
          "e": 6677.7,
          "t": "two words more harmful in the entire"
        },
        {
          "s": 6678.09,
          "e": 6680.29,
          "t": "English language than “good job”."
        },
        {
          "s": 6684.21,
          "e": 6686.94,
          "t": "But do you think there’s a line? You know"
        },
        {
          "s": 6687.74,
          "e": 6690.41,
          "t": "-- where you discourage the next Charlie"
        },
        {
          "s": 6691.05,
          "e": 6693.45,
          "t": "Parker from becoming Charlie Parker?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6698.77,
          "e": 6702.04,
          "t": "- CARL: No. Because the next Charlie Parker would"
        },
        {
          "s": 6702.59,
          "e": 6703.99,
          "t": "never be discouraged."
        },
        {
          "s": 6709.09,
          "e": 6712.23,
          "t": "<i>...And you? Are you back to playing now?</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6714.22,
          "e": 6716.95,
          "t": "Not really. Here and there... The playing"
        },
        {
          "s": 6717.6,
          "e": 6720.8,
          "t": "<i>never interested me. I never wanted to be</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6721.53,
          "e": 6724.79,
          "t": "<i>Charlie Parker. I wanted to be the man who</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6725.38,
          "e": 6727.98,
          "t": "<i>made Charlie Parker. The man who</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6728.78,
          "e": 6731.44,
          "t": "discovered some scrawny kid, pushed him,"
        },
        {
          "s": 6732.22,
          "e": 6734.22,
          "t": "him, shaped him into something"
        },
        {
          "s": 6734.68,
          "e": 6737.08,
          "t": "great -- and then said to the world,"
        },
        {
          "s": 6737.56,
          "e": 6740.16,
          "t": "“Check this out. The best motherfucking"
        },
        {
          "s": 6740.91,
          "e": 6742.51,
          "t": "solo you’ve ever heard.”"
        },
        {
          "s": 6748.87,
          "e": 6751.54,
          "t": "NICOLE: Who’s your Charlie Parker, then?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6754.42,
          "e": 6755.52,
          "t": "Sean Casey...?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6757.31,
          "e": 6760.38,
          "t": "CARL: Sean... Sean was a sweet kid... And with"
        },
        {
          "s": 6760.96,
          "e": 6763.56,
          "t": "all those idiots saying “This isn’t for"
        },
        {
          "s": 6764.13,
          "e": 6766.79,
          "t": "you”, Sean did something great. Very few"
        },
        {
          "s": 6767.33,
          "e": 6769.33,
          "t": "people ever get that chance..."
        },
        {
          "s": 6769.96,
          "e": 6771.62,
          "t": "But no... Not Sean Casey."
        },
        {
          "s": 6774.83,
          "e": 6777.56,
          "t": "The truth is I don’t know if I ever had a"
        },
        {
          "s": 6777.97,
          "e": 6779.1,
          "t": "Charlie Parker..."
        },
        {
          "s": 6781.71,
          "e": 6784.25,
          "t": "But I tried. And that’s more than most"
        },
        {
          "s": 6785,
          "e": 6788.2,
          "t": "<i>people can say, Andrew. I tried. And even</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6788.9,
          "e": 6791.1,
          "t": "if I never find one, I will never"
        },
        {
          "s": 6791.62,
          "e": 6793.02,
          "t": "apologize for trying."
        },
        {
          "s": 6795.17,
          "e": 6796.27,
          "t": "Pink (9/10/2013)"
        },
        {
          "s": 6800.01,
          "e": 6802.87,
          "t": "- <i>He’s a beautiful player, isn’t he?</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6806.08,
          "e": 6807.18,
          "t": "ANDREW: Yeah..."
        },
        {
          "s": 6813.49,
          "e": 6814.82,
          "t": "- Nice seeing you..."
        },
        {
          "s": 6816.49,
          "e": 6819.16,
          "t": "Look. I don’t know how you’ll take this."
        },
        {
          "s": 6819.99,
          "e": 6821.86,
          "t": "That band I’m for JVC -- our"
        },
        {
          "s": 6822.67,
          "e": 6824.33,
          "t": "drummer isn’t cutting it."
        },
        {
          "s": 6829.54,
          "e": 6830.94,
          "t": "Do you understand...?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6832.5,
          "e": 6834.84,
          "t": "I’m using the Studio Band playlist."
        },
        {
          "s": 6835.39,
          "e": 6837.92,
          "t": "<i>“Whiplash”, “Caravan”. I need a</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6838.44,
          "e": 6841.24,
          "t": "replacement who already knows those charts"
        },
        {
          "s": 6841.84,
          "e": 6842.94,
          "t": "inside out."
        },
        {
          "s": 6849.03,
          "e": 6851.77,
          "t": "Wh-- what -- what about Ryan Connolly...?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6857.75,
          "e": 6860.08,
          "t": "What about him? All he was was your"
        },
        {
          "s": 6860.44,
          "e": 6861.54,
          "t": "incentive."
        },
        {
          "s": 6864.73,
          "e": 6866.13,
          "t": "...And...and Tanner??"
        },
        {
          "s": 6870.39,
          "e": 6871.49,
          "t": "Pink (9/10/2013)"
        },
        {
          "s": 6875.03,
          "e": 6877.23,
          "t": "- ANDREW: He switched to pre-med."
        },
        {
          "s": 6883.01,
          "e": 6885.27,
          "t": "<i>I think he got discouraged.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6885.9,
          "e": 6888.57,
          "t": "We’re rehearsing next Tuesday. Why don’t"
        },
        {
          "s": 6888.93,
          "e": 6891.53,
          "t": "you take the weekend to think about it?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6895.4,
          "e": 6897.87,
          "t": "Rest up, gang. Call-time Sunday is 6."
        },
        {
          "s": 6902.12,
          "e": 6903.59,
          "t": "<i>ANDREW: Andrew.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6907.38,
          "e": 6908.48,
          "t": "Good job."
        },
        {
          "s": 6915.07,
          "e": 6916.2,
          "t": "Hope that was ok."
        },
        {
          "s": 6919.47,
          "e": 6921.47,
          "t": "<i>Yeah. You sounded good.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6926.93,
          "e": 6928.03,
          "t": "Thanks. You too."
        },
        {
          "s": 6930.22,
          "e": 6932.82,
          "t": "Is there...anything you worked out with"
        },
        {
          "s": 6933.55,
          "e": 6935.95,
          "t": "the previous guy that I should know?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6939.8,
          "e": 6940.9,
          "t": "Previous guy?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6946.12,
          "e": 6947.52,
          "t": "The previous drummer."
        },
        {
          "s": 6951.43,
          "e": 6953.89,
          "t": "Last week we rehearsed without drums."
        },
        {
          "s": 6954.3,
          "e": 6956.84,
          "t": "<i>You’re the only we’ve ever had.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 6963.45,
          "e": 6964.55,
          "t": "CARL: Hello?"
        },
        {
          "s": 6969.14,
          "e": 6971.48,
          "t": "- <i>Hey... It’s...it’s Andrew.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7028.11,
          "e": 7029.21,
          "t": "- Oh. Hey."
        },
        {
          "s": 7030.01,
          "e": 7032.74,
          "t": "I -- I just figured I’d call -- it’s been"
        },
        {
          "s": 7033.51,
          "e": 7036.17,
          "t": "forever, and I... I’m really sorry about"
        },
        {
          "s": 7036.78,
          "e": 7039.11,
          "t": "how I... I’m just so sorry... How I"
        },
        {
          "s": 7039.57,
          "e": 7042.3,
          "t": "acted... You know... (a beat; she doesn’t"
        },
        {
          "s": 7042.88,
          "e": 7045.55,
          "t": "respond; he sits down, trying to get the"
        },
        {
          "s": 7046.01,
          "e": 7048.95,
          "t": "- words out--) And I -- I didn’t know if you"
        },
        {
          "s": 7049.5,
          "e": 7052.1,
          "t": "knew -- I’m playing JVC this weekend..."
        },
        {
          "s": 7052.56,
          "e": 7055.23,
          "t": "<i>Maybe you’d like to come? We grab</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7056.02,
          "e": 7058.56,
          "t": "pizza afterward and complain about our"
        },
        {
          "s": 7059.27,
          "e": 7060.37,
          "t": "schools again..."
        },
        {
          "s": 7062.88,
          "e": 7063.98,
          "t": "JV?"
        },
        {
          "s": 7068.67,
          "e": 7070.27,
          "t": "[INDISTINCT CHATTER]"
        },
        {
          "s": 7071.07,
          "e": 7073.93,
          "t": "<i>Uh -- no, JVC. It’s a jazz festival.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7078.16,
          "e": 7079.26,
          "t": "Oh. Yeah."
        },
        {
          "s": 7083.59,
          "e": 7084.99,
          "t": "FLETCHER: When is it?"
        },
        {
          "s": 7087.21,
          "e": 7088.94,
          "t": "- <i>It’s next Friday.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7092.71,
          "e": 7095.71,
          "t": "<i>Ok... I don’t know, I’ll check with my</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7096.28,
          "e": 7097.38,
          "t": "boyfriend."
        },
        {
          "s": 7101.19,
          "e": 7102.29,
          "t": "...Got it."
        },
        {
          "s": 7107.99,
          "e": 7110.66,
          "t": "Yeah, I’ll check. I don’t think he likes"
        },
        {
          "s": 7111.28,
          "e": 7112.88,
          "t": "jazz though. I’ll check."
        },
        {
          "s": 7117.11,
          "e": 7118.21,
          "t": "Cool... Thanks."
        },
        {
          "s": 7119.44,
          "e": 7122.37,
          "t": "JIM: Alright, gang, listen up! 15 seconds to"
        },
        {
          "s": 7123.03,
          "e": 7125.76,
          "t": "get into places. For those of you who are"
        },
        {
          "s": 7126.36,
          "e": 7127.96,
          "t": "new to very simple: well"
        },
        {
          "s": 7128.52,
          "e": 7131.12,
          "t": "tonight, and the world will open up for"
        },
        {
          "s": 7131.52,
          "e": 7133.98,
          "t": "you. The folks out there, they make a"
        },
        {
          "s": 7134.7,
          "e": 7137.23,
          "t": "phone call and you’re a Lincoln Center"
        },
        {
          "s": 7138.01,
          "e": 7140.55,
          "t": "core. Or a Blue Note signee. Or an EMC"
        },
        {
          "s": 7141.39,
          "e": 7143.92,
          "t": "client. Drop the ball, and I’d suggest"
        },
        {
          "s": 7144.77,
          "e": 7147.3,
          "t": "switching careers -- because the other"
        },
        {
          "s": 7147.68,
          "e": 7150.08,
          "t": "thing about those cats is they never"
        },
        {
          "s": 7150.45,
          "e": 7151.55,
          "t": "forget."
        },
        {
          "s": 7156.58,
          "e": 7157.78,
          "t": "<i>It was you.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7159.11,
          "e": 7160.21,
          "t": "me what...?"
        },
        {
          "s": 7166.25,
          "e": 7168.98,
          "t": "Why do you think I invited you here? I’ve"
        },
        {
          "s": 7169.39,
          "e": 7171.66,
          "t": "<i>known it was you all along.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7173.55,
          "e": 7176.42,
          "t": "- Good evening, ladies and gentlemen. We’re"
        },
        {
          "s": 7176.96,
          "e": 7179.42,
          "t": "going to start things off with an old"
        },
        {
          "s": 7180.2,
          "e": 7181.8,
          "t": "<i>favorite of mine.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7186.58,
          "e": 7188.45,
          "t": "<i>The fuck?! Come on...</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7191.87,
          "e": 7193.47,
          "t": "[INDISTINCT CHATTER]"
        },
        {
          "s": 7196.35,
          "e": 7198.61,
          "t": "NICOLE: I guess you don’t have it."
        },
        {
          "s": 7203.36,
          "e": 7204.96,
          "t": "[DRUMS POUNDING]"
        },
        {
          "s": 7205.76,
          "e": 7208.1,
          "t": "- Didn’t you get the fucking chart?"
        },
        {
          "s": 7213.48,
          "e": 7215.08,
          "t": "Sir, you can’t be here--"
        },
        {
          "s": 7218.38,
          "e": 7219.98,
          "t": "[DRUMS POUNDING]"
        },
        {
          "s": 7223.47,
          "e": 7224.94,
          "t": "- You know each other?"
        },
        {
          "s": 7231.18,
          "e": 7232.28,
          "t": "<i>No.</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7235.62,
          "e": 7237.95,
          "t": "CARL: Alright, sir, that’s enough--"
        },
        {
          "s": 7239.33,
          "e": 7242.4,
          "t": "ANDREW: My -- my son -- I need to get my son--"
        },
        {
          "s": 7243.43,
          "e": 7244.56,
          "t": "Let’s calm down--"
        },
        {
          "s": 7247.46,
          "e": 7248.56,
          "t": "NICOLE: Andrew!!"
        },
        {
          "s": 7251.12,
          "e": 7252.22,
          "t": "<i>Andrew!!!</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7324.91,
          "e": 7328.37,
          "t": "<i>CARL: Thank you... For our final number we’re</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7328.92,
          "e": 7331.45,
          "t": "bringing it back to Ellington. This is"
        },
        {
          "s": 7331.91,
          "e": 7333.01,
          "t": "“Caravan”."
        },
        {
          "s": 7336.44,
          "e": 7337.54,
          "t": "Follow me four."
        },
        {
          "s": 7379.1,
          "e": 7380.2,
          "t": "Pink (9/10/2013)"
        },
        {
          "s": 7383.61,
          "e": 7384.71,
          "t": "- Fuck. You."
        },
        {
          "s": 7389.26,
          "e": 7391.6,
          "t": "JIM: I will gouge out your eyes you"
        },
        {
          "s": 7392.4,
          "e": 7393.5,
          "t": "motherfucker."
        },
        {
          "s": 7396.48,
          "e": 7397.68,
          "t": "Andrew -- Andrew--"
        },
        {
          "s": 7405.67,
          "e": 7408.01,
          "t": "<i>Take it back to the snare...</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7455.47,
          "e": 7456.57,
          "t": "Slow..."
        },
        {
          "s": 7459.32,
          "e": 7460.72,
          "t": "JIM: Single-stroke..."
        },
        {
          "s": 7462.05,
          "e": 7463.15,
          "t": "Up... Up..."
        },
        {
          "s": 7466.28,
          "e": 7467.68,
          "t": "Come on... Come on..."
        },
        {
          "s": 7473.76,
          "e": 7475.36,
          "t": "[INDISTINCT CHATTER]"
        },
        {
          "s": 7476.16,
          "e": 7478.36,
          "t": "FLETCHER: Come on...!! Come on!!!"
        },
        {
          "s": 7479.98,
          "e": 7481.98,
          "t": "Sorry... I’m -- I’m sorry--"
        },
        {
          "s": 7483.48,
          "e": 7485.48,
          "t": "- Pink (9/10/2013)"
        },
        {
          "s": 7486.98,
          "e": 7488.98,
          "t": "I’m sorry, I misun--"
        },
        {
          "s": 7490.48,
          "e": 7492.48,
          "t": "FLETCHER: Sure..."
        },
        {
          "s": 7493.98,
          "e": 7495.98,
          "t": "FLETCHER: At my age you get perspective."
        },
        {
          "s": 7497.48,
          "e": 7499.48,
          "t": "<i>You have a good weekend, bro?</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7500.98,
          "e": 7502.98,
          "t": "NICOLE: Ry..."
        },
        {
          "s": 7504.48,
          "e": 7506.48,
          "t": "That your dad you always come in with?"
        },
        {
          "s": 7507.98,
          "e": 7509.98,
          "t": "Dr. Fletcher would like to see you."
        },
        {
          "s": 7511.48,
          "e": 7513.48,
          "t": "Bravo."
        },
        {
          "s": 7514.98,
          "e": 7516.98,
          "t": "I guess that’s it, then. Any questions?"
        },
        {
          "s": 7518.48,
          "e": 7520.48,
          "t": "You know what I do?"
        },
        {
          "s": 7521.98,
          "e": 7523.98,
          "t": "I thought--"
        },
        {
          "s": 7525.48,
          "e": 7527.48,
          "t": "You ok?"
        },
        {
          "s": 7528.98,
          "e": 7530.98,
          "t": "CARL: I don’t know. Why? It’s just life."
        },
        {
          "s": 7532.48,
          "e": 7534.48,
          "t": "Stitched up at last,"
        },
        {
          "s": 7535.98,
          "e": 7537.98,
          "t": "<i>ANDREW: Pink (9/10/2013)</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7539.48,
          "e": 7541.48,
          "t": "<i>I...I have one more question...</i>"
        },
        {
          "s": 7542.98,
          "e": 7544.98,
          "t": "- CARL: Andrew Neiman?"
        },
        {
          "s": 7546.48,
          "e": 7548.48,
          "t": "I just decided to..."
        },
        {
          "s": 7549.98,
          "e": 7551.98,
          "t": "sure you’ll find your calling as"
        },
        {
          "s": 7553.48,
          "e": 7555.48,
          "t": "Yes..."
        },
        {
          "s": 7556.98,
          "e": 7558.98,
          "t": "Did I say to start playing again?"
        },
        {
          "s": 7560.48,
          "e": 7562.48,
          "t": "Nah, not this time, thanks..."
        },
        {
          "s": 7563.98,
          "e": 7565.98,
          "t": "I mean, it has to do something to you."
        }
      ]
    },
    "subsVisible": true,
    "autoSync": true,
