  },
  "script": [
    {
      "type": "center-title",
      "text": "MARTY SUPREME"
    },
    {
      "type": "center-title",
      "text": "BY"
    },
    {
      "type": "center-title",
      "text": "RONALD BRONSTEIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "center-title",
      "text": "JOSH SAFDIE"
    },
    {
      "type": "center-title",
      "text": "02/02/25"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "[Cue Tears for Fears’ ‘Change’]"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. NORKIN SHOES - STOCKROOM - LOWER EAST SIDE, NYC"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "C.U. of a shoe box. MARTY MAUSER [23, lanky, glasses] dumps out a pair of size 9 shoes onto the floor, replaces them with a size 8. Track with him and out of the stockroom, up the stairs..."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. NORKIN SHOES - BACK AREA - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "...past his uncle, MURRAY NORKIN [60s], seen through a glass windowed office, and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "IN T. NORKIN SHOES - MAIN FLOOR - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "...onto the main floor of the store. Push-in on a reverse shot of a seated CUSTOMER [40s, female, overweight]."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ms. Maryanne! You’re in luck. Last pair."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY gets down on one knee and tries to cram the CUSTOMER’s foot into the low-heeled shoe. The CUSTOMER winces in pain."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Text on screen: NEW YORK,"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "[End of Tears for Fears cue]"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CUSTOMER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "These are a 9?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MAR TY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, this brand runs really small...It’s annoying, it’s like they’re sized for dolls."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CUSTOMER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "They’re too tight. Do you have ‘em in a bigger size?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No, not in a Kerrybrooke."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY gets up and grabs a different shoe off the display rack."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "2.2."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Have you ever tried Vitality? Better make, more trustworthy, been around longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CUSTOMER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How much are they?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well in the long run, they’re the same as the Kerrybrookes."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CUSTOMER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Long run?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "They’ll last twice as long. It’s a matter of $11 now versus $7.50 twice. Do the math and they’re actually cheaper."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The door opens and a YOUNG WOMAN enters [20s, frizzy hair, ethnic-Jewish]. MARTY takes note as she approaches another salesman, LLOYD [30s, blonde, doughy, non-ethnic]."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "YOUNG WOMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, I bought a pair of shoes here the other day..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The CUSTOMER tries the new shoe on and models them in front of a floor mirror. MARTY steps back."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "These look much nicer around the ankle."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Marty!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yep?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This woman says she bought a pair of shoes from you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY looks at t he YOUNG WOMAN."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh yeah, you bought the brown Mary Janes. How are they?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "3.3."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "YOUNG WOMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Great. If you remember, I wore them out the store."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t, but ok."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "YOUNG WOMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well, I left my old ones here."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hmmm. What did they look like?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "YOUNG WOMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Two-toned pumps...Matrix ones."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t recall seeing those."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "YOUNG WOMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "They were wing-tipped..."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to LLOYD)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You see anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "LLOYD shakes his head."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "YOUNG WOMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Is it possible you maybe put them in one of the boxes o f the other shoes I was trying on and restocked them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t see how. What else were you trying on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "YOUNG WOMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "There were a bunch. I’m a 6."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I can’t go searching through every size 6. You remember which brands?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "YOUNG WOMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "If I saw the boxes, I’d probably be able to recognize them."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CUSTOMER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Excuse me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "4.4."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to CUSTOMER)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m sorry. You mind if my colleague helps you out for a minute?"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to LLOYD)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can you handle this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY gets up."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to YOUNG WOMAN, put out)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Follow me."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY leads the YOUNG WOMAN towards the back room."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. NORKIN SHOES - BACK AREA - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "As they get close to the back office, MARTY silently gestures for her to stop and wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Shhh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Through the window, MARTY can see MURRAY searching his desk, sandwich in hand. He turns and makes eye contact with MARTY."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Marty. Come in here."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY enters, annoyed, leaving the YOUNG WOMAN in the hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. NORKIN SHOES - MURRAY’S OFFICE - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Here. I got you something."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MURRAY draws a business card out of a box and hands it over. It reads: “NORKIN SHOES -- FAMILY FOOTWEAR -- NEVER-ENDING SOLES”."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Flip it over."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The back-side reads: “MARTY MAUSER -- MANAGER”."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Manager? Come on, Murray."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "5.5."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Be excited. It’s a promotion. Just maybe don’t mention it to Lloyd just yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, I’ve been very clear. No disrespect to you, you’ve built something really commendable here, and its been good for me see it up close. But I’m just not a shoe salesman. It’s not me, it’s not my function."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We don’t need to have this conversation now."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s not gonna change. Once I’m back from my trip , that’s it, I’m not coming here anymore. Speaking of which, you think we can settle up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We’ll deal with it at closing."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But I was planning on going to the travel agent on my lunch break."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sure, I give you the money now and you won’t come back after your lunch break."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Aw c’mon. You think I would do that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes. I said we’ll take care of it at closing."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MURRAY turns back to his mag azine. MARTY waits a beat, then exits."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. NORKIN SHOES - BACK ROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He silently beckons the YOUNG WOMAN to come. She ducks and scuttles on her knees past the office window. They descend the stairs."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "6.6."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. NORKIN SHOES - STOCKROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY and the YOUNG WOMAN -- his girlfriend, RACHEL MIZLER -- stumble into the stockroom making out. It’s sloppy. passionate. Between kisses..."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sorry, my place is off limits today, Ira’s home sick."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(pulling away)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Whoa, whoa! I can’t get sick!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No, no, it’s food poisoning."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You sure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL pulls him back into her. They start kissing again."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "[Cue Alphaville’s ‘Forever Young’]"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY hikes up Rachel’s skirt, rips off her garter belt, slips his hands between her legs, pushing her against a wall of shoeboxes. He spins her around. They begin to have sex."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(whispering in her ear)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I wish I could hide you in my luggage."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(whispering)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I wanna come with you so bad. CUT TO BLACK:"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Thousands of writhing sperm enter the frame, racing towards a large white ovum. They surround the egg, each fighting for entry, until one finally breaks through. In slow-motion, the egg begins to drift and rotate, revealing the words “MARTY SUPREME - MADE IN AMERICA” screen-printed on its surface."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The egg makes contact with a hard green surface, bouncing off it and sailing past a series of soft-focus shapes in the background. The shapes slowly begin to take form. They are human faces in states of great excitement. The egg then makes contact with another hard surface -- a ping pong racket -- and the moment it does, it’s launched over a net at blistering speed."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "[End of Alphaville cue]"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "7.7."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. LAWRENCE’S PING PONG PARLOR - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY — stripped to a sleeveless undershirt, dripping in sweat — practices table tennis opposite his friend WALLY [20s, Harlem native]. Excited onlookers follow the ball with their eyes. One of them, DION [30s, heavyset] roots for MARTY with awed enthusiasm. LAWRENCE [60s, Barbadian] oversees the training."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LAWRENCE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fore-hand.. Forehand... Forehand... Back hand... backhand... backhand..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY looks demonic. He smashes the ball again and again, forcing WALLY to back up to the wall."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A telephone rings. The camera pushes into a phone booth as a MISFIT [typical Lawrence’s weirdo] answers it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISFIT"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, hold on...Marty!...MARTY!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "WHAT???!!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISFIT"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Phone!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Tell him..."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(smashing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I left 20 minutes ago, that I’m"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(smashing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "already on my way back to the s tore."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISFIT"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s a her."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The ball hits the top of MARTY’s paddle, flies upwards, hits the ceiling and bounces to the floor. DION runs to retrieve it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "GODDAMMIT! SHIT!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(at self)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "DAMMIT!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to WALLY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The white shirt threw me off."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You stupid bitch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "8.8."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It did. I can’t see the white shirt against the white ball."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fuck you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Take it off!"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. PHONE BOOTH - MOMENTS LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY enters the booth and picks up the receiver."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JUDY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s Judy. Your mother, she’s very sick."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh yeah?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JUDY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "She’s lost color in her face, she’s speaking nonsense. You should come home. She’s asking for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(oddly indifferent)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Maybe call an ambulance then."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JUDY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And who’s going to go with her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You I guess, since you’re so invested."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JUDY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hold on."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY waits, looks down. Zoom into the Marty Supreme ball in his hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. JUDY’S APARTMENT - LOWER EAST SIDE - SAME TIME"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "JUDY [70s] has her hand cupped over the phone. Marty’s MOM [40s, high-strung] stands in the threshold of the front door."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "9.9."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JUDY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(whispering)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s not buying it. The little shit."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(whispering)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Tell him I passed out."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "JUDY un-cups her hand from the receiver."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JUDY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(loud)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh Christ- she what???"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(into phone)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "She just lost consciousness, you need to come home now."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "In the hallway, behind MOM, RACHEL walks up the stairs carrying groceries. She takes note of the situation and continues up."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. RACHEL’S APARTMENT - 2 FLOORS UP - MOMEN TS LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL rushes into her apartment and beelines for the phone. Her husband -- IRA -- calls out weakly from the bedroom."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "IRA (O.S.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "One second."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL carefully picks up the receiver. It’s a party-line, allowing her to eavesdrop on JUDY’s conversation downstairs."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JUDY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "-sure, I’ll take her to the ER and wait for God knows how long and you can give my husband his medicines and m assage his legs all night-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh just put her on the phone already."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JUDY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I told you, she passed out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "10.10."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(into phone)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Don’t listen to them! They’re lying!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JUDY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "GET OFF THE LINE! IT’S OCCUPIED!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL quickly hangs up as IRA [late 20s, stocky] comes to the doorframe -- clearly unwell."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "IRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who’s lying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, Judy. She said she would be off the phone an hour ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(beat)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I got you some broth."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "IRA reaches his hand inside the bag."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "IRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s ice cold."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sorry, there was a long line at the shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "I RA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh yeah? Is that what they’ll say if I call down and ask?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Be my guest. You gotta get Judy off the line first."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "IRA picks up the receiver."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "IRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(angrily)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Get off the phone!"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. HARDWARE STORE - MIDTOWN - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "DION keeps watch while MARTY grabs a can of spray paint off a shelf and paints a ping pong ball orange."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "11.11."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. GALANIS OFFICE - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY and DION sit across from DION’s father CHRISTOPHER GALANIS [60s, stocky]. MARTY is moving a white ping pong ball across a white piece of paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok, this is a normal IATT approved ball. Try to follow the white ball against the white. See how your eyes get lost?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "GALANIS follows the ball with his eyes. MARTY then does the same thing with the orange-painted ball."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "M ARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Now try it with the orange ball. You’re already following it way better. See how his eyes are looking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY puts the ball down."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Right now, in the world of table tennis, you’re obliged to wear black just so you can follow the ball."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to DION)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Show him the Esquire article."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "DION places a magazine on the table, open to a picture of a professional table-tennis player dressed in black."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MA RTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s Ted Bailey, last year’s world champ. I’ve already beat him. See how he’s wearing all black? Now show him the Jack Kramer spread."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "DION quickly shuffles to a huge profile on American tennis player, Jack Kramer, wearing all white."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Now what’s the difference?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s wearing white."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "12.12."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "See how classy Kramer looks? To me that’s class-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "A custom ball like that is going to cost a lot more though-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know math, dad. I’m not stupid."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But what’s it gonna cost?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We can’t cheap out on this! It’s the Marty Supreme Ball not the Marty Normal Ball."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s gonna be nominal, Mr. Galanis-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t know. I want a coffee. Dion, go get me one."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Just ask Nancy to get you a coffee."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "She’s busy. Get me the coffee."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We’re talking like men about business-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(raising his voice)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Get me the damn coffee!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The room falls silent. Humiliated, DION get up and exits the room."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(gravely)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, my son...He’s limited. He’s thirty years old, he’s still living at home. I’m happy that he has something to do but-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Something to do? This is a legitimate career oppo rtunity for him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "13.13."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "My point is that there are limits to what I’m willing to spend."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "So stick with the white then. But I’m telling you, you’re gonna regret it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I wouldn’t be here trying to involve you in something that I didn’t believe in. And I know it’s hard to believe, but this game fills stadiums overseas. And it’s only a matter of time before it fills stadiums in the United States too. Before I’m staring at you from the cover of a Wheaties box."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. ORCHARD STREET - DUSK"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "We track with MARTY as he runs across 3rd Street, scarfing down a hot dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t know anything about this business."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s why you have to trust me."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He arrives at Norkin Shoes, tries the door. It’s locked."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (V.O.) (CONT’D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This time next week I’ll be the first American to take the Br itish Open. That’ll slide me into the #1 ranking spot for the World Championship. Life is gonna cover it, they have to. Look’s definitely gonna cover it. The guy there, he loves me. They all love me. I’m telling you, I am uniquely positioned to be the face of the entire sport in the U.S."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY looks into the shop. The place is empty, closed for the night. He then spies LLOYD coming out from the ba ck areas carrying some shoe boxes. MARTY bangs on the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "14.14."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Annoyed, LLOYD places the boxes on the counter, walks over and lets him in."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. NORKIN SHOES - MAIN FLOOR - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m closing up."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I can see that. I’m just here to speak to my uncle."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He left."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "LLOYD heads to the register. MARTY follows."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What?! For the day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He had to take your mother to the hospital."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh for crying out- She’s not sick!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "LLOYD stares dispassionately."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He owes me money. We’re supposed to settle up."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Maybe you should’ve thought about that before you took a 5 hour lunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh shut up."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "LLOYD pulls the drawer from the till and heads to the back room. MARTY quickly grabs the phone and dials."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sounds like you’re feeling a lot better."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah no thanks to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "15.15."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Enough. You with Murray?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No. I think he left for his trip."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Trip!? What trip!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s taking Esther to Kutchers for the weekend, which I’ll add he was willing to cancel out of concern for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s supposed to give me my money for my flight!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t know anything about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Of course you do! It’s the only reason I agreed to work here."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That ’s strictly between you and him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh so I guess it’s just a coincidence that he skips town the exact time he’s supposed to pay me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I have no idea what you’re implying-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m not implying anything. I’m saying he’s a fucking snake."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You watch your mouth. That man pays our rent and puts food on our table."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You know what this is? This is sabotage. You’re sabotaging me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MO M (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh you wanna talk sabotage? YOU'RE SABOTAGING YOUR WHOLE LIFE YOU BUM--"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "16.16."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY hangs up on her and heads to the back room."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. NORKIN SHOES - BACK ROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The second MARTY enters the room, LLOYD swings the safe shut and spins the combo."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What was that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY laughs in disbelief."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You think I’m gonna rob you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sorry, just a reflex."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "If I wanted to rob you you’d be dead. I just came in here to grab my suit."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY removes a suit from the clo set and slings it over his arm."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You know, I bought this specifically for my trip."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Not sure why a person needs a suit to play ping pong, but ok."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Lemme explain something to you, Lloyd. This was a business trip. Do you know what business is, Lloyd?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Guess not."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY lingers by Murray’s desk. He quickly reaches into Murray’s desk drawer, pulls out a gun and points it at LLOYD."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Al l I want is the 700 dollars that Murray owes me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "17.17."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh yeah? Or what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Or I'll shoot you in the leg."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No you won’t."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You sure about that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You shoot me in the leg and you're going to be spending the next few years in jail."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Maybe I’ll shoot you in the head instead."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re not gonna do that either."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, I just want what I was promised to me. Not a penny more. I’m gonna be coming home with times this amount in prize mo ney. Turn the other cheek and I’ll give you an even hundred when I get back."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LLOYD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Not interested."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Lloyd, let’s get deep for a second...We both know you’d love nothing more than to see my ass get canned. You’re 1000 times more responsible than me and still, check this out..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY fishes out the Norkin Shoes business card and hands it to him. LLOYD picks it up and reads: “MARTY MAUSER -- MANAGER” ."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m gonna be your boss. How unfair is that? I could fire you whenever I want."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He’s got LLOYD’s attention now."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "18.18."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, I’m actually pointing a gun at you. I’m actually threatening to use it. These are facts. My fingerprints are all over this thing. It's a legit robbery, like any other. So open the safe, lemme take what I’m owed, and you can call Murray, tell him exactly what happened, get me fired, press charges, whatever the fuck you want. Ok?"
    },
    {
      "type": "transition",
      "text": "CUT TO:"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The camera pushes into a C.U. of a safe dial being t urned."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "[Cue Peter Gabriel’s ‘I Have the Touch’]"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. 20,000 FEET IN THE AIR"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A Pan American propeller plane soars through the sky."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. AIRPLANE - FIRST CLASS - DUSK"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY sips coke from a glass, chewing ice. He peers out the window at a lightning storm raging in distant clouds."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. LONDON CENTRAL HOSTEL - NIGHT"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY carries his luggage down the hallway of a run-down dormitory. Two men in towels pass f rom the opposite direction, clearly recognizing him. MARTY greets them cooly. Text on screen: LONDON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY gets to his room and opens the door. The dingy room contains four occupied bunk beds. A NORWEGIAN is lying on his back, reading a dog-eared copy of Rimbaud’s ‘A Season in Hell’ by flashlight."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We don’t even get our own rooms!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "NORWEGIAN just stares."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And it’s freezing in here."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "NORWEGIAN points to a coin-operated machine affixed to the wall."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "19.19."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "FRENCHMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Heat costs 10 p."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A rat jumps up from under the bed and snatches a sandwich from a plate balanced on the NORWEGIAN’s chest."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. WEMBLEY STADIUM - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Every player competing in the British Open stands in pyramid formation. A PHOTOGRAPHER readies a large studio portrait camera. Zoom in on MARTY. He takes note of 3 Japanese players and nudges the man next to him, BÉLA KLETZKI [late 30s, Hunga rian]"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Check it out. BÉLA Yeah, Japan sent a team this year."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What about the travel ban? BÉLA They must have lifted it."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY stares at the Japanese players. They look poised, austere."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PHOTOGRAPHER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok paddles up...And on the count of 3..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY smiles ear to ear. *FLASH*"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "[End of Peter Gabriel cue]"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. WEMBLEY STADIUM - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "An exhibition floor bifurcated into 12 sections arranged for tournament-st yle table tennis, all manned by players from around the world. Text on screen: ROUND"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Marty trades ferocious shots with his first opponent [text on screen: AMIT VISHWAKARMA, INDIA, RANKING: 21]. After an intense rally, MARTY smashes an impossible-to-return shot [text on screen: MARTY MAUSER, USA, RANKING: 2]."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The scoreboard flips from 20 to 21. MARTY shakes hands with AMIT. He notices the crowds h ave largely gathered by a table on the other side of the hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "20.20."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Marty makes his way across the room, toweling his face and neck. Arriving, he watches a frustrated British player [text on screen: TED BAILEY, UNITED KINGDOM, RANKING: 1] struggling against a Japanese opponent who has barely broken a sweat [text on screen: KOTO ENDO, JAPAN, UNRANKED]. MARTY quietly addresses a SPECTATOR."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Where are we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SPECTATOR"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "3rd game. Bailey’s getting slaughtered."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ECU of E NDO’S paddle. It looks different from the others, a thick piece of soft-rubber affixed to its surface. Eerily, it emits no sound when it makes contact with the ball."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What is that thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SPECTATOR"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t know."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s silent."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SPECTATOR"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Like a ghost."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "CU of ball spinning off Bailey’s racket seemingly defying physics."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. WEMBLEY STADIUM - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Text on screen: ROUND 3. MARTY plays with great flair against a man in his 30s [text on screen: VLADIMÍR SEBEK, CZECHOSLOVAKIA, RANKING: 12]. MARTY wins several points in a row."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. WEMBLEY STADIUM - IATT OFFICE - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A stern looking MARTY, sweaty from game play, makes his way into a large busy office. He makes a beeline for RAM SETHI, the head of the International Association of Table Tennis ."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ram Sethi, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m on the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "21.21."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I see that. Marty Mauser."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes, I know who you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m sure you do."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(into phone)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Would you mind holding?"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to MARTY, annoyed)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can I help you with something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m curious, where you staying while you’re in town?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Excuse me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I am asking you what hotel you’re staying at."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well, all of the IATT representatives are stationed at the Ritz."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s what I heard. And you t hink that’s ok?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m not sure what you’re-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Don’t give me that. Have you seen where you’ve put me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We offer complimentary housing to all of our players, Mr. Mauser. And as far as I know, you are the only one to complain."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Cause I’m not everyone. You know perfectly well what an American win is going to do for the future of this sport. I’m good for table tennis, Mr. Sethi!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "22.22."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then perhaps you should appeal to the USTTA for something better."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Is that a joke!? There is no USTTA. It’s two guys and a desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m finding this whole exchange highly offensive."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah? You know what’s really offensive? Making your star player huddle in a rat’s ass."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. RITZ HOTEL - LOBBY - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A press junket is underway in the elegant lobby of the Ritz Hotel. MARTY holds court, s eated with a group of reporters."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "REPORTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This is a nice hotel, the IATT covers accommodations?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Only for their star players."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "REPORTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Is that right? How many are there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Star players? I don’t know. I haven’t seen any others around, so one."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "REPORTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What about Ted Bailey?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What about him? He lost. He’s already out of the competition."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "REPORTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s the Japanese player who beat him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MA RTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, annihilated him. Ted’s blaming it on this new bat the guy’s playing with."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "23.23."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "REPORTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "New bat?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s like a sponge. It absorbs contact and shoots it back out at you. A lot of players are whining about it, trying to get it banned. It’s annoying. I hate crybabies."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "REPORTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Any nerves going into the semi’s against Kletzki tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re kidding right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "REPORTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He has quite the reputation."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Listen, I’m basically gonna do to Kletzki what Auschwitz couldn’t..."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(paus e for effect)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m gonna finish the job."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The REPORTERS laugh uncomfortably."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s ok guys, I’m Jewish, I can say that. In fact, I’m Hitler’s worst nightmare."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "REPORTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And why’s that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Just look at me. I’m here. I’m on top. I’m the ultimate product of Hitler's defeat."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The REPORTERS jot in their notepads."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, write that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "REPORTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Tell us a bit about your background."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY does a fake cartoonish snore. The group laughs."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "24.24."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But seriously, my mother died in childbirth, my father was a compulsive loser who abandoned me when I was 2. I got stuck in the city orphanage system til I was 16-"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "REPORTER 1 and 2 talk quietly to each other ‘Look, that’s Kay Stone isn’t it?’..’Who?’ ‘Kay Stone, the actress, that’s her I think’ etc."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "-where they shuttled me from one hellhole to the next. Naturally, that led to some troubl e with the law... (to REPORTERS 1 and 2, noticing they’re not paying attention) Excuse me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "REPORTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sorry. Kay Stone is over there checking in."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY and the other reporters watch a wealthy couple in their 50s -- MILTON and KAY ROCKWELL -- cross the lobby, a bellhop trailing them with a cart full of expensive luggage."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who’s that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "REPORTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The movie actress. From the 30s."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY glances over. Cle arly he’s never heard of her. KAY makes brief eye contact with him as she heads to the front desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Next question."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. RITZ HOTEL - ROYAL SUITE - MORNING"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY sits on the bed in a lavish suite, phone receiver pressed to his ear. He’s wearing a plush robe, newspapers and room service trays splayed out in front him. He sips fresh squeezed juice."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "25.25."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Kay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Speaking."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It's Marty Mauser, I'm in the Royal Suite. I saw you in the lobby yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I was being interviewed. We made eye contact."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sorry, I don’t recall."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well, I’m a huge admirer."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can I help you with something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Maybe. I just ordered one of everything off the room service menu and there’s no way I’ll be able to eat it myself ."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re inviting me to your room?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How about I send my husband up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sure, I’ll leave the door open for him and I’ll come down to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Wait, wait, wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Pause."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "26.26."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I want to keep talking."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Cause I’ve never talked to an actual movie star before."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well now you have. Hope it’s all you imagined it to be."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY picks an apple up off a tray, walks around tossing it to himself."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You got the Daily Mail on you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(a beat, looking around)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, yes. Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Open it to page 12."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. RITZ HOTEL - DOVER SUITE - SAME TIME"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY opens the newspaper and flips to an article from the previous day’s junket: headline “THE CHOSEN ONE?”, accompanied by a photograph of MARTY, glasses off, holding the Marty Supreme prototype next to his face."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This is you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s right."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You play ping pong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Table tennis, yeah. I’m here competing in the British Open."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How old are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "27.27."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY starts absentmindedly filling in ‘hair’ on a photo of a bald man in the newspaper with a Rockwell Roller pen."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "23!? I bet you can’t name one movie I was in."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What makes you say that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Cause I stopped acting before you were even born."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Really? That’s interesting. Why’d you stop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON steps out of the bathroom, towel around his waist, his neck bleedin g from a shaving nick."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Did you shave your legs with my razor again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who’s that your husband?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well then someone must’ve snuck into our room in the middle of the night and chopped wood with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m on the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "With who?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Debbie."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON, annoyed, walks back into the bathroom."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Is he gone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "28.28."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Great. So why’d you give up acting? Let’s talk about that. Don’t you miss it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m hanging up for real now."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You should come see me play at Wembley tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, that’s not happening."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "C’mon, you can watch me dethrone the number one ranked player in the world."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m not free."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why, what do you have going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "My husband is holding a big promoti onal event if you must know."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Promoting what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Pens."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Pens!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s a pen salesman?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Actually, he owns Rockwell Ink."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh. I know Rockwell ink. What’s the event?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "29.29."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s hired Agatha Christie to sign her new book at Hatchards."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sorry but that sounds really boring."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY hangs up on him. She stares down at the newspaper. The phone rings again."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(annoyed)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sorry. One last question. Does your room face the street or the courtyard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Just answer the question."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t know, the courtyard."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok, do me a favor and go look out the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY sighs, gets up and walks to the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What floor are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Third."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok. See the open window? With a bowl of fruit on the table?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mmm hmmm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "30.30."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "If I can make an apple appear in that fruit bowl, you blow off your rendezvous with Miss Marple and come watch me play."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m not agreeing to this."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well I’m doing it anyway. Keep your eye on the bowl...In 3...2...1..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "An apple rockets through the air from somewhere above, flies into the open window and lands in the bowl, knocking the other fruit onto the floor. A woman abou t KAY’s age runs into the kitchen."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE) (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ll leave a ticket at the box office."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "*Click* MARTY hangs up. The woman in the window across the street turns and makes eye contact with KAY."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. WEMBLEY STADIUM - LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Tracking shot with KAY as she makes her way through the arena, taken aback by the throngs of spectators watching the game. Text on screen: SEMIFINALS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She gets to her seat and fixes h er attention on MARTY, who stands at a table at the center of the arena floor, locked in a heated rally against BÉLA KLETZKI [text on screen: BÉLA KLETZKI, HUNGARY, RANKING: 5] MARTY finishes the point with a smash. The arena applauds. KAY looks around, then turns back to MARTY as he runs his hand through his hair and fixes his glasses."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "It’s now match point, with MARTY leading 20 - 9. MARTY gives a quick wink to BÉLA. BÉLA serves. MARTY does an elegant spin and returns the ball behind his back. Collectively the crowd lets out a gasp. BÉLA immediately returns the ball behind his own back, generating scattered laughs and applause. Feeding off the attention, MARTY leaps up high and flamboyantly returns the ball between his legs. BÉLA mimics the move. The crowd jumps to its feet cheering. KAY takes it all in, clearly in a world she doesn’t understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A shot of ENDO and the Japanese team watching attentively. A shot of SETHI, clearly not amused. MARTY nonchalantly flicks the ball off the sole of his right foot. BÉLA does the same. The ball sails back high, close to the net."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "31.31."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY leans forward, takes a deep breath and blows hard into the ball, sending it back gently. BÉLA takes the cue and slams it past MARTY, who makes no effort to return it. The crowd erupts."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY places his finger to his lips, quieting the arena. KAY watches on bated breath. BÉLA intentionally serves into the net, forfeiting the point. BÉLA and MARTY raise their hands and bow."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. RITZ HOTEL - D INING ROOM - NIGHT"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY and BÉLA sit at a table in the hotel restaurant."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Get whatever you want. Don’t even look at the prices. BÉLA What are you gonna get?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The beef Wellington. And the caviar tasting plate. BÉLA Ok, I’ll get that too. I want to keep talking about the Globetrotters though."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I told you, I’m not interested. BÉLA But why? It’s good money. We’d get to travel all over the world -"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Performing trick shots while people get up to use the bathroom. That sounds good to you? Where’s the waiter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY scans the room, sees the MAITRE D, waves him over. Behind the MAITRE D he sees KAY seated with her husband and approx 10 others on the other side of the restaurant."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The MAITRE D approaches."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MAITRE D"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can I help you, sir?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "32.32."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We’d like to order."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MAITRE D"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ll inform your waiter."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hang on. I’m going to be taking care of the Rockwell tab tonight. Put it on my room."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MAITRE D"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Very well. Should I let Mr. Rockwell know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Of course. And don’t take no for an answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY watches the MAITRE D head towards MILTON’s table. MARTY keeps his eyes on BÉLA."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look at me, keep talking. BÉLA Who is that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Some bozo. Ok, yo u can look over, but be subtle about it. What’s he doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "BÉLA looks and sees the MAITRE D in conversation with MILTON. MILTON turns to look toward’s MARTY’S table."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "BÉLA He’s looking at us."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Talk casually. BÉLA I think you should reconsider. We’d make a great team."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY darts a glance over to KAY, who’s now looking at him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Come on. The Harlem Globetrotters? You’re not serious. BÉLA Is there som ething I don’t know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "33.33."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Some of the greatest athletes on the planet, reduced to acting like circus clowns. It’s pathetic. What’s he doing now? BÉLA"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(glancing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s walking towards us. It would give us steady work, all the way up to the Championship."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No offense, Béla, but I’m on a different path."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON arrives at their table."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m sorry, do I know you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t think so."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY glances over at KAY watching t hem."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And you want to pay for my dinner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "If that’s ok."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "May I ask why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Do I need a reason?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Let me rephrase that. What is it that you want?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t want anything. Just consider it my small way of saying thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Thank me for what exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "For all of your products. I mean where would we be without pens?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "34.34."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A pause."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You know, I have many talents but the one I’m most proud of is the ability to smell bullshit from a mile away-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What? I’m being completely sincere."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(beat)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "So where in the States are you from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "New York."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Us as well. And what do you do if you don’t mind me asking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m a professional athlete."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Interesting. What sport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Table Tennis."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Table Tennis? T hat’s a sport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Of course. I’m here representing the U.S. in the British Open. In fact, tomorrow is the finals. I’ll be facing off against Japan in front of a sold out crowd at Wembley."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "There’s a Japanese team?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s what I just said."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "They lifted the travel ban for table tennis?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "35.35."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sure. Table tennis happens to be the fastest growing sport in the Asias. Oh, you’ll like this. You know what they call their grip?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Excuse me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The way the Japanese hold their rackets. They call it ‘pen holder’. You can have that by the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Have it for what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t know. For an advertisement or something. Like I said, table tennis is a phenomenon over there. Shit, I’m being rude. This is my associate Béla Kletzki."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "They shake hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You play table tennis as well I presume."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Béla was the World Champion from to 39. I beat him earlier today."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON notices the tattoo on BÉLA’s forearm."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I see you were in one of the camps. BÉLA Yes, Auschwitz-Birkenau. Why do you ask?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "My son lost his life liberating you. BÉLA I’m sorry for your loss."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Wait, I thought you were liberated by the Soviets?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "36.36. BÉLA We were."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I wasn’t being literal. My son was stationed in the South Pacific."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What happened to him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What do you mean? He was killed."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well, if its any consolation, I’ll be dropping a third atom bomb on their heads tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes, I’m sure it will bring his mother great comfort to hear you’re playing ping pong in his honor."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m glad. Béla here used to defuse bombs for t he Nazis. Tell him the story you told me, with the bees."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "My guests are waiting."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hang on, you’re gonna love this. BÉLA Ok, well, when I first got to the camp, this was in Dachau not Auschwitz, I was put into housing."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY looks over to KAY. They hold intense, unbroken eye contact."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "BÉLA (CONT'D) Lucky for me one officer recognized me. He had seen me play at the World Championships in 1936 in Prague. This guy was a real fan. He began to set up games for me and him and the other guards. Then he moved me to an office where they taught me how to dismantle SC bombs-"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "37.37."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Wait, you’re telling me they let you live cause you play ping pong? BÉLA They respected my skills."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. AUSCHWITZ-BIRKENAU - 1944 - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "BÉLA sits by the edge of the woods -- a barbed wire fencing visible in the distance -- hunched over a small 50kg bomb."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "BÉLA (V.O.) So each morning they’d send me into the woods with the bombs, on the outskirts of the camp, where I’d only be a danger to myself. I discovered I could finish the job in twenty minutes time, so I’d spend the rest of the day fiddling about, pretending that they were still active. One time-"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "BÉLA notices several bees. He gets up and begins to follow them."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. WOODS - 1944 - SOON AFTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "BÉLA (V.O.) -I followed a honey bee to its hive-"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "BÉLA is standing on his tip-toes blowing cigarette smoke into the hive, forcing the bees to evacuate. BÉLA casually swats them away, bearing the stings with grim stoicism."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "BÉLA (V.O.) -and smoked all the bees out. I broke it open and smeared the honey all over my body. And later-"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. AUSCHWITZ-BIRKENAU - BUNKER - 1944 - NIGHT"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "BÉLA lifts his shirt over his head. Prisoners crowd around BÉLA, greedily licking his naked chest and arms, struggling to gain real-estate on his body."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "BÉLA (V.O.) -that night, I let all my bunkmates lick the honey off of me for nourishment."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "38.38."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. RITZ HOTEL - TOP FLOOR - MIDDLE OF NIGHT"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Isn’t that the most romantic thing you’ve ever heard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY exits the elevator, approaches the Royal Suite and knocks. MARTY answers in his underwear, no glasses. A pregnant pause. She has a feral look in her eye. He steps aside. She enters the room."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. RITZ HOTEL - ROYAL SUITE - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY moves further into the room. MARTY follows. She turns around, maintaining intense eye contact with him. MARTY approaches, removes her coat. She has nothing on but undergarments. They collapse onto the bed. Slow zoom into the mirror on the opposite wall, as MARTY stares at himself admiringly while she climbs on top of him."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. WEMBLEY STADIUM - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A coin flip. MARTY loses. First serve goes to Endo. MARTY assumes his place at the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Text on screen: FINALS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The stadium is packed, standing room only. SETHI, BÉLA, BAILEY, all clap from their respective seats."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Text on screen: GAME"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO serves. The ball zooms past MARTY, he doesn’t even make contact with it. ENDO serves again, sending the ball to MARTY’s forehand. MARTY gives it back at 100-miles-plus. ENDO returns it at such blinding speed that MARTY can’t get it back over the net."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "With increasing shock and embarrassment, MARTY loses the first 5 points in a row."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. WEMBLEY STADIUM - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The score 6-2, ENDO. The crowd is completely silent."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Text on screen: GAME"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY’s natural elan has faded, replaced by manic focus. He’s smashing every single return with the maximum power he can harness."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "39.39."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Given the sponge’s ability to absorb force and double it on return, MARTY’s only hope is to hit the ball so hard ENDO won’t be able to make contact with it. MARTY wins two points this way."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON and several of his executives enter the arena and take their seats."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO runs over to his coach, who speaks sternly to him. MARTY snaps his fingers at an official."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey, hey hey! What’s that shit?! The re’s no talking now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO trots back to the table. MARTY serves. ENDO starts sending the ball back to MARTY’s backhand, knowing that MARTY can’t produce the same power from a backhand. MARTY loses the point."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON watches stone-faced."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. WEMBLEY STADIUM - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The score is 18-15, ENDO. Text on screen: GAME"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY has reversed his strategy, hitting the ball with almost no power. The softness drast ically reduces the effectiveness of the sponge, but it makes the rallies monotonous. ENDO’s approach is to simply wait out MARTY’s patience...19-17...20- 17. Match point."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "After a tedious rally, MARTY loses patience and goes in for a kill shot. The ball comes back like lightening, MARTY sends it into the net. It’s over. The cup goes to ENDO. The house jumps to its feet, with the exception of MILTON a nd his associates, who remain seated, talking to one another. MARTY loses all composure."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "THIS IS COMPLETE AND UTTER BULLSHIT!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Photo flashes are going off in rapid succession."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "REMATCH! I WANT A REMATCH! WITH A STANDARD LEAGUE HARD BAT, RIGHT NOW!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "All attention is on ENDO. A trophy is being brought out."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "40.40."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to officials, yelling)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "WHAT IF I SHOWED UP WITH A MECHANICAL ARM, HUH!?! OR HOW BOUT I PUT GLUE ON THE FUCKING BALL?!! WOULD THAT BE KOSHER!?!? HE’S A FUCKING CHEATER! I PLAY REAL TABLE TENNIS! REAL TABLE TENNIS!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The cheers rise to a deafening roar. MARTY smashes the table with his racket, damaging both. MILTON laughs. Another bulb flash. FREEZE FRAME on MARTY’s blown-out enraged face."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Dieg etic sound drops out, except for the audible crackle of an optical track, followed by tinny orchestral music played in a military-march style..."
    },
    {
      "type": "transition",
      "text": "CUT TO:"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The ‘Japan Film Corporation’ logo appears on screen, in black & white, followed by a title card in Japanese characters."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Translation: Japan Wins the 19th British Table Tennis Open"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A NARRATOR speaks in Japanese over 16mm footage of the tournament at Wem bley. Note: all of the narration is subtitled in English."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NARRATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "For the first time since the end of the Pacific War, a Japanese athlete has triumphed on the world stage. His name is Koto Endo."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Footage of ENDO winning points against various players."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NARRATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This underdog from Japan brought shame to the American frontrunner, beating him three games in a row."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Footage of ENDO winning th e final point against MARTY and MARTY’s post-loss tantrum."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NARRATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It is reported that one hundred thousand people awaited his return to Tokyo."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Massive throngs of Japanese civilians cheer on ENDO as he’s driven past them waving."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "41.41."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NARRATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "However, Mr. Endo says he is returning home, not a hero, but a humble craftsman."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Footage of ENDO in his workshop, methodically disassembling a spring-driven clock."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NARRATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "At the age of 16, Mr. Endo lost his hearing during the Great Tokyo Air Raid."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Footage of war torn Tokyo -- a vast landscape of charred rubble and twisted metal."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NARRATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Without the distraction of sound , he tuned himself to the rhythm of the game."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Footage of ENDO practicing table tennis in a gymnasium."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NARRATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And so, with the entire table tennis community turning its attention to Japan, Tokyo has been chosen to host this year’s World Championship."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Footage detailing the construction of a brand new exhibition center in the rehabilitated Tokyo city center."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NARRATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The American will su rely return, desperate to reclaim his pride."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Footage of a MARTY at Wembley, assuming his place at the table opposite ENDO."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NARRATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But Koto Endo will not step onto the court alone. Behind him, million souls join hands with the determination of a nation reborn"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Footage of ENDO -- stoic, determined -- preparing to serve."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. 5TH ARRONDISSEMENT - PARIS - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY walks down a busy street b ordering the Seine."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Text on screen: PARIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "42.42."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He approaches a restaurant and enters..."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. LARUE - PARIS - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "...into a large dining room with wrap-around windows overlooking both the Seine and Notre-Dame. MARTY approaches the MAÎTRE D’."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(speaks no French)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey. I’m here to see Milton Rockwell. MAÎTRE D' Pardonne-moi?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Milton...ROCK...WELL...Reservation."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The MAITRE D’ reads a logbook in front of him."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. LARUE - DINING ROOM - AFTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Trackin g shot: a waiter brings a tray of soup and a salad to MILTON and MARTY’s table. MILTON is in the midst of showing off an expensive watch to MARTY. He hands it to MARTY as the soup is placed in front of him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(looking at watch)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Gorgeous. What’s this, custom crystal?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Of course. Try it on. You can wear it while you eat. I’ve always thought that the watch makes the man. I wear two because I can."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(looking down to salad, upset... to waiter)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Excuse Moi.."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(waiter turns around)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I ordered a salade Lyonnaise. I don’t know what this is, but can you take it away and bring me the right one? Merci."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(waiter removes food from table, turning to MARTY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I wanted to thank you in person for introducing me to the world of table tennis. Who knew?"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(MORE)(MORE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "43.43."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON (CONT'D)MILTON (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s quite the phenomenon in the Asias, particularly in Japan."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(strapping on watch)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s what I was trying to tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "In fact, we’re thinking of incorporating it into some promotional events over there."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Table tennis? How so?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY salts his soup and then takes a huge spoonful. A pause. MILTON studies him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You know, if you were here interviewing for an executive position at my company I’d be telling you to leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY instinctively wipes his face with his napkin."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I got something on my face?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You salted your soup without tasting it first."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY is at a rare loss for words."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Anyway, we’ve been floating the idea of staging a public exhibition between you and Endo, timed around the World Championship, to capitalize on all the media attention. I a ssume you’ll be attending?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You kidding? It’s literally all I think about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "44.44."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Perfect. We can offer you a fee of dollars. Accommodations at the Tokyo Imperial. If you’re planning on leaving from New York, you’d have the option of joining me on my plane. You would be traveling in style-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well, we can negotiate my price later. I’m thinking aloud here but would this event happen before or after the tournament?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "About a week before."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sorry, but no, it woul d have to be after. I can’t face off against the guy in public before it actually counts. Drama is very important to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Let’s not get hung up on specifics. Right now I’m just trying to gauge if this is something you’re open to."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sure, I’m open. I’m open to any opportunity to show off my talents. Speaking of which, you don’t have to worry, cause I’m gonna obliterate him this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "W ell, hold on. I want to be clear about your role here. This is strictly a promotional event, it’s not a competition. The point is to entertain the Japanese people, so that they buy pens, you understand? What you do at the tournament is your own business. Here, you’ll play a few games, make a show of it, but you can’t play better than him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What? You want me to lose?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "45.45."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "One second..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON pulls out a Japanese magazine and opens to an article about Marty’s defeat in London. MARTY flips through it, aghast, stopping on a photo of him with his head in his hands in a state of anguish."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You realize, you’ve made Endo a symbol of national pride-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You think this makes me want to lose? This makes me wanna win!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sometimes when you lose, you’re a winner . Let me explain-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m a million times better than Endo."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I couldn’t care less. What I’m presenting here is theater."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But it’ll look real to the people watching, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I think you’re-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Just answer the question. Yes or no."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(annoyed)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’ll look real in the way actors on a stage look real."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But when you watch an actor on a stage you know it’s pretend."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(definitively)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No. U h uh. There’s no way."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Really?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "46.46."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes, really. I’m not about to throw my reputation in the trash for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Your reputation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes my reputation."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Aren’t you currently in town performing in some kind of vaudeville circus act?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What do you mean? What does that have to do with anything!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re the half-time show."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(defensively)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "For the Harlem Globetrotters! The finest athletes on the planet! I’ve probably played in front of 80,000 people since January-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Alright, let’s stop. I can see our thinking is too far apart."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(unbuckling the watch)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, try worlds apart."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(hands over the watch)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Here."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Thanks. It looked stolen on your wrist anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fuck you."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON laughs."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s funny to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re funny to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "47.47."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You know what’s funny to me? That you want to entertain the Japanese so badly, and meanwhile, they murdered your son. That’s funny to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON’s entire disposition stiffens. A tense pause."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, that came out a little stronger than I intended-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We’re done. I’d like you to leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You hit a nerve, I hit a nerve. We’re even now."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "GET OUT!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY switches gears."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Actually, n o. I believe you owe me a meal."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY reaches for the shaker and adds salt to his soup."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "[Cue The Korgis’ ‘Everybody’s Gotta Learn Sometime’]"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. AUDITORIUM - BOSNIA - EVENING"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "‘Sweet Georgia Brown’ blasts over the PA. The Globetrotters are in full slapstick mode, playing in an outdoor stadium in the rain."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Text on screen: SARAJEVO"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "C.U. of a greasy MC introducing the half-time show in Bosnian. MARTY and BÉLA run out onto the court, big fake theatrical smiles, giant spot tracking their movements. The crowd is unenthusiastic."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY and BÉLA assume their positions at a ping pong table and begin to hit balls with various-sized pots and pans, playing out the notes of ‘Twinkle Twinkle Little Star’."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "48.48."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. AUDITORIUM - GREECE - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY and BÉLA sit on the floor of a basketball court playing ping pong at a novelty miniature table."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Text on screen: ATHENS"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. AMPHITHEATER - MOROCCO - NIGHT"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY and BÉLA entertain the crowd with a choreographed multi- ball rally. Five balls fly in the air in looping arcs."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Text on screen: TANGIER"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. PYRAMIDS - EGYPT - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The Globetrotters sit on camels at the Giza pyramid complex while a photographer takes pictures of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "We zoom past them to MARTY and BÉLA, standing at the base of one of the pyramids. MARTY is chiseling away at a cornerstone with a pocketknife."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Text on screen: CAIRO"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A piece of stone breaks free in MARTY’s hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MID-SIZED ARENA - FRANCE - NIGHT"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A packed house. MARTY stands at the ping pong table. An MC makes an introduction in French. A spotlight roams around the arena floor, landing on MAURICE, a sea lion wearing a ruff. The crowd goes bananas. A trainer leads MAURICE to the table. It hops up on a pedestal and is fed a fish."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Text on screen: PARIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A drum roll. MARTY serves the ball. MAURICE returns it with its flipper. MARTY loses the point on purpose."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A wild burst of uproarious laughter and applause from the audience. MARTY force s a smile, but behind it, the humiliation settles deep."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. TENEMENT BUILDING - LOWER EAST SIDE - AFTERNOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY -- bedraggled from travel -- enters the shitty ground floor entryway to his building with his luggage."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Text on screen: NEW YORK"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "49.49."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "[End of Korgis cue]"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. TENEMENT BUILDING - LOWER EAST SIDE - AFTERNOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY lugs his suitcase up a narrow flight of stairs. As he rounds his landing, JUDY exits his apartment. She is surprised to see him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JUDY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, hello."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY passes her, saying nothing. He takes out his keys and opens the door to his apartment."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MAUSER APARTMENT - MAIN ROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MOM, standing in the kitchenette, freezes at the sight of him. MARTY walks straight to his room avoiding eye-contact."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MAUSER APARTMENT - MARTY’S ROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY enters his bedroom. It’s spare, neatly kept - one wall dedicated to newspaper clippings, ribbons and trophies. He places his suitcase on the single bed next to a rubber-banded bundle of mail. He notices a near-empty glass of juice on his desk, grabs it and exits."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MAUSER APARTMENT - MAIN ROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY walks the glass to the sink."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Please don’t eat or drink in my room. It attracts bugs."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I only go in there to clean."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY washes the glass thoroughly."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You don’t seem very happy to see me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "50.50."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And you don’t seem happy to see me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Of course I’m happy to see you. I thought you were dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No you didn’t. Did my trophy arrive?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What trophy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "My winning trophy from London. I had it shipped here."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "All your mail is on your bed."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok, I’ll check the post office."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY pours himself a glass of orange juice from a can, drinks it in one go. MOM watches, clearly on tenterhooks."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MO M"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "So you’re gonna be staying here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(pointedly)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Is that not ok? Don’t worry, I’m only in town for a few weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Don’t be stupid."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(beat)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’s in a few weeks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The World Championship."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh. And where’s that happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Tokyo."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Tokyo Japan?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "51.51."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Are you asking me if Tokyo is in Japan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You look tired."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, that’s cause I just traveled half-way around the world. I was working. I was making money."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY heads back to his room. We wait with MOM."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(calling out)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why don’t you go and take a long hot shower while the whole building’s at work...I have some chicken, if you want that."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY returns with a ribboned box in his hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I got you something."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY hands her the box. She opens it. Inside, a jagged stone."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s from an original Egyptian pyramid."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MOM stares down at it blankly."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(proudly)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We built that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. TENEMENT BUILDING - BATHROOM - LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A cramped bathroom filled with steam. MARTY rigorously soaps his face in the shower. A bubble forms in his mouth and then pops."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. TENEMENT BUILDING - HALLWAY - AFTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY exits the bathroom -- a towel around his waist -- and heads back to his apartment."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "52.52."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Nosey neighbors linger in the hallway. They exchange awkward glances with MARTY as he passes."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MAUSER APARTMENT - MAIN ROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY enters. A uniformed COP is there waiting for him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The COP approaches with handcuffs."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Turn around and put your hands behind your back."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What???"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I SAID TURN AROUND AND PUT YOUR HANDS BEHIND YOUR BACK!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The COP forcefully turns MART Y around and begins to handcuff him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re under arrest for armed robbery."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MURRAY comes out of the bedroom."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Murray! What’s going- Where’s my mom?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I told her to leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You told her- What the fuck is going on here!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Watch your mouth."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to COP)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sal, give us a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sal!? You know this guy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "53.53."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Go into the bedroom. Close the door. I wanna talk to him alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The COP enters the bedroom, closes the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That was my money, that you owed me-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No. It was mine, and you stole it at gunpoint."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No, no, no. You promised me that money for my trip. We both know that."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And what happened on your trip?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What do you-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You lost! So was it worth it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No, I didn’t. I was ch eated against-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Stop. How many times have I-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh gimme a break, don’t start with that shit."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Answer the question. How many times have I picked up the phone in the middle of the night, come down and bailed you out."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey, I’ve never once asked you for help."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well, I did. And now you’re gonna be a big boy."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "A “big boy”!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "54.54."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes. A big boy. Look, I’m not going to be able to support your mother forever-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You won’t have to!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh no? Cuz why? You’re going to step up and take care of her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, I’m gonna step up on a level you can’t even imagine. She’ll be living on Fifth Avenue with an elevator and man inside who takes you up-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s enough. I’m laying out two options here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(beat)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "First one is, you t o come back to the shop. This time no bullshit. You take it seriously, I give you more responsibility. Truth be told, you’re an amazing salesman-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I could sell shoes to an amputee, so what!? What’s the other option?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I press charges for armed robbery, with Lloyd as a witness, and you go to jail."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re not doing that."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh no? We’ll see about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey! Sal!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The COP steps out fr om the bedroom."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "55.55."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MAUSER APARTMENT - LIVING ROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How much is he paying you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’s that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You heard me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s enough Marty!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No! How much is my uncle paying you to scare me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Excuse me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Cause whatever it is, I’ll double it for you to suck my dick."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What did you just say to me?!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The COP gets right in MARTY’s face. MARTY winces."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ugh, brush your teeth. What’d you, gargle d iarrhea-"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The COP slaps him across the face."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey, hey hey!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He hit me, Murray! He hit me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to COP)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s crazy, don’t listen to him, everything’s settled, we’ve got it all worked out."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(pulls a wad of cash from his inside pocket)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "See? He’s agreed to pay me back the money-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Wait, where’d you get that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "56.56."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "From your luggage."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY flips out, lunges at MURRAY."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "ARE YOU OUT OF YOUR MIND?! THAT’S MY MONEY FOR JAPAN!!! YOU HAVE NO FUCKING RIGHT TO--"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The COP violently yanks him back towards the front door."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s it. We’re going downtown."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No! No! Stop! I’ll stop! Murray! Help!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Apologize to him right now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok, ok. I’m sorry. I’m sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You gonna behave?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok...H ere’s what were gonna do. You’re gonna get dressed. We’re gonna meet your mother at the Garden Cafe. And we’re gonna have a nice family meal together, put all this nonsense behind us."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to COP)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Take the cuffs off."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You sure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The COP removes the handcuffs."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok, go get dressed. I love you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "57.57."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY enters his bedroom and shuts the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re nephew’s a real piece of shit."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to COP)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sorry about that. Here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(draws a bill from the roll of cash)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Take an extra 10."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Alright...So Garden Cafe, huh? What’choo getting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The pastrami, what else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Pastrami, meh."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why, what do you get?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Roast beef."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(laughing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Roast beef!? Goyishe cop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. TENEMENT BUILDING - FIRE ESCAPE - MOMENTS LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY steps out of his bedroom window and starts descending."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MAUSER APARTMENT - LIVING ROOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MURRAY knocks on the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Marty, lets go."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(pause)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Marty?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MURRAY goes to open the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MURRAY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s enough. Come open this door."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "58.58."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Pause. The COP rams the door open. It’s empty. The COP runs to an open window that leads to a fire escape. He pops his head out and sees MARTY climbing down below. He pulls himself in from the window and rushes to the living and out the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(yelling below)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "FRANKIE!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. STREET - LOWER EAST SIDE - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "COP 2, seated behind the wheel of a police car parked below, pokes his head out the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "HE’S COMING DOWN THE SCAPE!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "COP 2 turns his head to sees MARTY throw his duffle bag down to the sidewalk. They make eye contact."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COP"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh shit."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY breaks into a sprint. COP 2 drives in reverse after MARTY."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY races down the block as the squad car smashes into a fruit stand filled with watermelons."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. ESSEX STREET - LOWER EAST SIDE - MOMENTS LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY runs like hell, skirting ped estrians."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He runs right past IRA, not even noticing him. IRA looks and sees the COP turn the corner now on foot."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY continues his sprint down the block. On a dime, he slows himself down to a walk and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. ESSEX STREET PETS - LOWER EAST SIDE - MOMENTS LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "...casually enters a large pet store. Behind a rabbit enclosure, RACHEL tends to a MOM and her DAUGHTER. She looks over the enclosure at MA RTY, shocked to see him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey... Can I use the phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "59.59."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY walks to the counter, picks up the phone, dials."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(into phone)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Wally...Yeah, I just landed...Stop. Do me a favor, call my house and...Let me talk...I need you to call my house and tell my mom that you just got off the phone with me, you’re supposed to meet me at Lawrence’s, but you’re running late..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He shifts his attention to RACHEL and in doing so notices she is very pregnant. She notice s that he notices."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You working tonight?...Great, meet me at the Halsey on 28th, bring the cab and as much cash as you can get your hands on...Yeah...No, I wanna try that place in Jersey that Quinn was talking about...Wally, it’s hours away, no one’s gonna recognize me out there...Just- I’ll see you in a bit, ok?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY hangs up, agitated."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM CUSTOMER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can we hold her?... Miss?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, sorry. Yes ."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She opens the case and passes the rabbit to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "One minute, I’ll be right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She approaches MARTY."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I really don’t have a lot of time right now. Is there a way out the back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She walks to the back room. MARTY follows."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. ESSEX STREET PETS - BACK ROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She closes the door behind them."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "60.60."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Aren’t you going to say something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh... Congratulations?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Congratulations?! Are you- I’ve been trying to get in touch with you for 8 months!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I wouldn’t know. I’ve-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I left a million messages with your service!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, I can see what you’re trying to do and it’s not gonna work."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Excuse me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s not mine, Rachel."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It is absolutely yours."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I pull out, does I ra pull out!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What are you saying-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s a simple question, just answer it yes or no."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL begins to cry."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY looks to the back door, then to RACHEL who cries in her hands. He brings her in close, embracing her."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m sorry. I’m all messed up..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY kisses her head. She cries into his shoulder."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I lost in London by the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "61.61."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "IRA suddenly enters the back area, out of breath. RACHEL quickly pulls away from MARTY and wipes the tears off her face."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "IRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’s this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Marty’s father just died. I was consoling him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "IRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Bullshit."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ira, this is my friend since I was years old."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "IRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Am I talking to you!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Now you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Marty, don’t-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "IRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No. Keep going. I’ll rip that unibrow right off his fucking forehead."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You w anna get physical with me? Like an ape?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A pause. IRA stares him down, then does a sudden about-face and storms out of the shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh god, this is gonna be a whole thing now, you have no idea."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Through the glass, they see IRA yelling down the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "IRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "HEY!!! OVER HERE! HE’S IN HERE!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "GOD DAMMIT!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’s going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "62.62."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I gotta go! We’ll talk later."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY rushes to a back window, it’s jammed shut."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No, here."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL opens a side door. MARTY dashes out."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. COMMUNAL BACKYARDS/ALLEYWAYS - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY flies down a flight of stairs and through an alley, leading to a small backyard boxed-in by 9’ concrete walls."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He vaults himself up one of the walls and onto a narrow walkway. He scuttles across the walkway, looking for a place to jump down. It’s 8 foot drop to the backyard of a Chinese food restaurant."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY hesitates, then jumps into a pile of garbage bags to break his fall. He quickly conceals himself under the garbage."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "COP 2 appears on the walkway above. He barks questions to a few CHINESE COOKS smoking cigarettes nearby. They either don’t know or pretend to not know English."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY stays completel y still under mounds of rotten trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. HALSEY HOTEL - LOBBY - LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A bloodied BEAT-UP MAN pleads into a payphone."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "BEAT-UP MAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, it’ll be the last time, I promise...To the Western Union...Come on, Ma...I’m having a very rare day...Hang on, I need to add time..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "BEAT-UP MAN looks over and sees MARTY waiting in the lobby."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "BEAT-UP MAN (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Excuse me, sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(already annoyed)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "BEAT-UP MAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You got a nickel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "63.63."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY (O.S.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey! Stupid!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY turns and sees WALLY -- dressed in a cabbie’s uniform -- entering the hotel. MARTY heads towards him. They embrace."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Damn, you smell disgusting. Like rotten fish."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, I know. I need to get a room and hose off before we split. Come."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "They approach a DESK CLERK seated behind a cage."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How much for a room for the night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "dollars."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to WALLY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Lemme get 4 bucks."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(opening wallet)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m just letting you know, we only got 10 to play with."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "10?? What kinda money we gonna make off that?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You fucking call me with no notice. I just paid rent today! I got kids!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to DESK CLERK)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can you give me anything cheaper? I don’t care what it looks like."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "There’s a room on the 5th floor, but you can’t use the shower-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How muc h?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "64.64."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "2.50"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MISHKIN [60s, seedy hulking presence] interrupts. He’s got a German Shepherd on a leash with dogshit caked in its fur. WALLY backs away from the dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Gimme my key."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "DESK CLERK grabs it off the hook."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’s that smell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He had a little accident."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It smells like shit."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You smell like shit, Jimmy."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "BEAT-UP MAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(into phone, speeding up his speech)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ma ma ma, please they’re gonna disconnect us, please just send the money, you have the address."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. HALSEY HOTEL - ROOM 503 - BATHROOM - AFTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "C.U. of running faucet. MARTY checks the water temperature with his hand. Note: The bathtub is buttressed by a series of wooden stints holding it in place."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m telling you, there’s no way."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY (O.S.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "When’s she due?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How should I know? Al l I know is it’s not mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY (O.S.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You wear a raincoat?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "65.65."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. ROOM 503 - MAIN ROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "WALLY, fully reclined on a chair, flips through MARTY’S mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (O.S.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t need one."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What, you shoot blanks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (O.S.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You kidding? I have super sperm, and I shoot far."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "WALLY laughs."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sounds to me like you’re gonna be a daddy."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY steps into the room and begins to pull clothing from his duffle bag."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Do you know what continence is Wally?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(fucking with him)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No, and I don’t care."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Pulls a pair of pants from the bag. WALLY opens a letter."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Every time I take a piss, I pull back, hold my urine in and count to ten Mississippi. That’s how you build up the muscle. Nothing gets through unless I want it to."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(noticing WALLY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Are you going through my mail???"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Gimme that. What’s wrong with you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY puts the mail in his bag and re- enters the bathroom."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. ROOM 503 - BATHROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY removes his towel and gets into the tub."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "66.66."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY (O.S.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’s the Ritz?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. ROOM 503 - MAIN ROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "C.U. of letter. It’s an itemized bill from the IATT, stating that MARTY’s application for the World Championship has been denied, and cannot be approved until his balance of $1,480 is remitted."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Cuz you got a bill here for 1,500 dollars."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. ROOM 503 - BATHROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "WALLY enters the bathroom with the l etter."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s from the IATT. They banned your little white ass!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(bolting upright)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Gimme that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The floorboards suddenly give way."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. ROOM 403 - BATHROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The tub splits the crossbeams, severs pipes, and plummets to the floor of the bathroom below. It lands on MISHKIN, in the midst of giving his DOG a bath. MARTY is violently tossed to the floor. Water and huge hunks of plaster rain down."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The fallen tub has landed upright, pinning MISHKIN’s arm and shoulder. Blood pools into the water. He screams."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "AHHHHH! MY ARM! MY FUCKING ARM!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The DOG’ is trapped underneath the fallen tub. It thrashes trying to get out. MISHKIN struggles to free himself. MARTY sits in a daze. WALLY’s face appears in the ceiling-hole above."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "67.67."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Holy shit. Marty! MARTY! You alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY checks himself."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(confused)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I-I think so."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Please. Get this offa me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY turns to see MISHKIN pinned under the tub behind him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh my god."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to WALLY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "CALL AN AMBULANCE!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY hops out from the tub."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to MISHKIN)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hold still. I’m gonna try to move it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "My dog...He’s gonna drown."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY sees the dog trying to escape from under the tub. It’s barking. MARTY tries to lift the fallen tub. The raining water makes it hard to get a grip. He takes a deep breath and manages to lift the tub by inches."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(great strain)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Slide out, quick!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MISHKIN gets his arm free. The DOG jumps out, starts circling the bathroom in a panic, crying."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Help him."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY notices MISHKIN’s arm. It’s badly broken, bone exposed, gushing blood."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Your arm."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(looking)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I think I’m gonna pass out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "68.68."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hang on."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY takes off MISHKIN’s belt and loops it like a tourniquet around his arm. MARTY cinches the belt. MISHKIN shrieks. The DOG meanwhile is still circling the room."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Here, here, come, good boy."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Someone starts pounding on the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MALE VOICE (O.S.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "YOU ALRIGHT IN THERE!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. 5TH FLOOR HALLWAY - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "TRACKING SHOT: MARTY rushes down the hallway wrapped in a towel and enters his r oom."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No, I’m not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. ROOM 503 - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY walks to the bathroom grabs his glasses and rushes to his luggage and begins to pack in a hurry."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I mean, you hurt? That was crazy."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY starts to get dressed."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m getting our money back."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Let’s just get out of here."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fuck that, we need that money."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s 2 dollars and fifty cents. It’s not worth the noise."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "69.69."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Forget about 2.50, I’m asking for way more than that."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. 4TH FLOOR - HALLWAY - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The elevator door opens. MARTY and WALLY exit. The hall is flooded. Seedy hotel guests loiter outside their doors, some are laying towels at the bottom of the doorframes to stop the water from entering."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to WALLY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Wait here."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY enters the room."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. ROOM 403 - MAIN ROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY beelines for the bathroom. A WORKER is precariously balanced on top of the tub, trying to redirect the broken pipe spouting water. The DESK CLERK stands cautiously below guiding the WORKER through a maze of pipes."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Take your sock off and stuff it in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WORKER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You wanna switch? You take your sock off."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey! I-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You! I told you not to use the fucking bath!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’re you talking about?! No y ou didn’t!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Don’t even start."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m not the one who rented the room. I could have broken my neck!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That can still happen!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "70.70."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Are you threatening me!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, I am!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A SECOND WORKER appears in the hole up above."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SECOND WORKER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The basement is locked."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Goddammit! Who’s got the key?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SECOND WORKER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t know. Stan is looking for an axe."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, I want my money back for the room, and also reimbursement for all my shit that got ruined."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Are you serious!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Two EMTs with a stretcher enter the room and peer into the bathroom."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, good, you’re here."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The DESK CLERK rushes past MARTY and directs them towards the bedroom, where MISHKIN lies in a puddle of blood on the bed. MARTY follows him to the bedroom and lingers in the doorway."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s his arm. He’s lost a ton of blood."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MISHKIN panics as they begin to transfer him onto the stretcher."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(in immense pain)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Wait! What about my dog!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The dog circles in a panic, barking, crying...etc."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "EMT"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Stay calm. Don’t move."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "71.71."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Stop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to DESK CLERK)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I need someone to take him to the vet."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I told you, we don’t have anyone free."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He could have internal bleeding. The tub crashed on him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He seems fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "A friend of mine got hit by a car and he seemed fine and then he died hours later."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DESK CLERK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I have to wait for the fire department."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to MARTY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You. Please. You gotta help me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ m sorry. I-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I just need someone to drop him at my vet. That’s it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I can’t-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He needs to be looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ll get fired, I’m already late for work-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ll pay you double, triple what you make. I don’t care. Please. This dog is my whole family."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Shit...Where’s the vet located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "72.72."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "13th and 1st. Just pound on the door until he answers."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "EMT"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sir, you gotta stop moving."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Open up my bag."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY reaches for the satchel, opens it. It’s LOADED with cash."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Count out 50 for yourself, take another 50 for the vet. Let him know I’ll be there as soon as I can."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY starts counting out 5 and 10s."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(fighting to stay conscious)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re a fucking mensch, kid."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. TAXI CAB - LINCOLN TUNNEL - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Tunnel lights whip hypnotically past the dashboard. WALLY drives. The DOG paces back and forth on the back seat wheezing. MARTY is pouring bourbon from a flask onto a paper cup of ice-cream."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He seems weird. We should just turn around and bring him to the vet. Fifty dollars is more than enough to play with."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY finishes pouring and extends the cup to the DOG. It s niffs at it and then ventures a lick, then another."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, you know what’s more than fifty? A hundred! We can clean house tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Don’t be greedy you Jewish motherfucker."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "73.73."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You saw the fine! We gotta do this every night for the next two weeks or I’m fucked, that’s it, no Japan."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m not taking off work for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can we just stay in the moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY pours more bourbon into the cup. WALLY notices."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Easy, that’s my shit."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The DOG greedily laps up the bourbon and ice cream."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to DOG)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, that’s a good boy."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The DOG starts to choke."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He sounds terrible, maybe loosen up the collar."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY leans over, unbuckles the dog’s collar."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’ll be fine. We’ll drop him at vet on the way back. What’s a couple hours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY reads the name on the dog tag."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Moses”...Wow."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. BOWLERO - CRANBURY, NEW JERSEY - LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY enters a crowded bowling alley and crosses the room, passing occupied lanes and clusters of ping pong tables. He stops in front of a table where WALLY -- both nostrils stuffed with toilet paper -- is playing against TERRY [early 20s, blonde]."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "74.74."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. BOWLERO - TABLE 1 - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY stands by the side of the table and watches WALLY play. WALLY loses a point."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TERRY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s 17 to 6."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "My serve."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "TERRY hits the ball to WALLY. WALLY sends a serve off the back edge. ROGER [20s, beady-eyed, cocky] calls from an adjacent table."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who wants next?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ll take it if no one’s got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY approaches the table and picks up a paddle."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. BOWLER O - TABLE 3 - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s a dollar a game."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Let’s rally first."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nah, put up or shut up."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY fishes a dollar from his pocket and displays it. ROGER does the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I serve."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ROGER serves. MARTY fumbles to return it, misses."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Do-over. I wasn’t ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "1-0."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Meanwhile, TERRY smashes a ball past WALLY."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TERRY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Game."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "75.75."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. BOWLERO - TABLE 1 - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "WALLY pulls the fat money roll from his jacket pocket and peels off a bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Here."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TERRY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Keep it. You’ve had a bad enough night as it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nah, fair’s fair."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TERRY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I shoulda spotted you a least points anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "WALLY wipes his brow and takes a seat next to a CLARK KENT type."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CLARK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’s up with your nose?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Got jumped by a fare."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CLARK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fare?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yea h, I’m a cab driver. I drive the guy all the way from Manhattan. Second we pull over, he punches the back of my head, grabs my money and books."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CLARK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Looks like it got ugly."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, I caught up with him, beat his ass, took my roll back, and then I took what he had."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CLARK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well I’d be careful. You’ll wind up losing it here. Not everyone’s as nice as Terry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "76.76."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who’s the best guy here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CLARK"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(pointing at ROGER)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Roger. Stay away from him."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "They watch MARTY and ROGER play. MARTY is holding the paddle amateurishly, like a hammer. He performs a wild slam. The ball has no chance of hitting the table. ROGER stops it from flying astray with his racket."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hit your racket, my point."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’re you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You gotta let it fall off the table. Use yo ur paddle, counts as a hit, my point."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to group)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s a known rule."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s ridiculous."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s called cheating."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fine, take the point. 4-1. Serve."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY attempts an overcomplicated serve. It falls into the net."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Shit!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "5-1."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY serves again, this time connecting. They rally."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TRISH (O.S.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "ROGER!!!...ROGER!!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ROGER looks over to TRISH -- his girlfriend, standing across the room by th e lanes -- and misses."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TRISH (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "OUR LANE IS READY! THEY’RE GONNA GIVE IT AWAY."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "77.77."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ROGER begrudgingly throws his racket on the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I gotta go."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You forfeit? Gimme my dollar."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I was destroying you. You’re being spared."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Bullshit."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ROGER runs off to join TRISH."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey!"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(beat)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Screw it. Who wants next?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ll play."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY hits the ball over the net to WALLY before he gets to the table. WALLY spastically rushes to return it. They struggle to keep a sustained rally g oing. MARTY smashes the ball, missing the table and hitting WALLY in the neck."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What the hell, man!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY laughs. CLARK and others watch."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Pull out your dollar."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fuck you, how bout 5?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You don’t have money like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "WALLY pulls the cash roll from his pocket."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Wow. You must have mugged someone."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why don’t you put your money where your mouth is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "78.78."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How bout I put my penis where your mouth is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY fishes out 5 bucks."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to CLARK)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey, you mind holding?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "CLARK takes 5 dollars from each of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(gesturing to ROGER at his lane)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I hope I can trust you more than that asshole over there."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY grabs a ball and lowers his hands below the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Pick a hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "WALLY points to the left hand. MARTY raises it above the table, the ball in h and. WALLY’s serve. They engage in a sloppy rally."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. BOWLERO - LANE 5 - LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "STRIKE! Pins fly in every direction. A bowling ball barrels down the return alley and rises up into the carousel. ROGER looks over to the tables and sees a large crowd gathered around MARTY and WALLY’s game."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to TRISH)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ll be back before my next turn."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Track with ROGER as he makes his way to the tables."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. BOWLERO - TABLE 3 - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ROGER addresses a READHEADED guy at the back of the crowd."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’s going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "READHEAD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Match point. Colored guy’s bout to lose all his money."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "79.79."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "WALLY and MARTY are drenched in sweat. WALLY’s ball goes long."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That grazed the edge. I heard it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No way."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I saw it change direction!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nope, didn’t touch. Pay up."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "CLARK looks sympathetically towards WALLY."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "See what happens when you talk shit? It stinks doesn’t it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "CLARK hands the winnings over to MARTY. WALLY pities himself."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Lemme keep a few dollars for gas money...please."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "M ARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Absolutely not. You shoulda thought of that when you placed the bets."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How’m I supposed to get back to the city?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(counting money)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I dunno. Walk."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "WALLY puts on his cabbie hat and jacket. CLARK calls out to ROGER."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CLARK"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Roger! Come. Play him for this guy’s gas money."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ROGER steps up."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You? Nah you’re too good. Plus you’re a welcher."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "80.80."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ll spot you 4 points."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fine. 40 bucks."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What? I don’t have that."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(mocking)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Put up or shut up”"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to group)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who’s got cash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY readies himself to play while CLARK works his way around the room collecting wads of cash."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. TAXI CAB - CRANBURY, NJ - LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "High excitement. WALLY surfs the radio dial while MARTY counts up their winnings. MOSES paces around the back seat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Two hundred, two-oh-five, two-ten, two-eleven, two-twelve..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "WALLY lands on Fats Domino’s “The Fat Man”. MARTY sings along."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "They calllll me the fat man!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Cuzzz I weigh 200 pounds."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Three hundred, three-oh-five..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "WALLY lets out an ecstatic scream as Fats launches into his vocal solo. He slows the cab down to a crawl, throws it into neutral and hops out onto the road -- the vehicle now moving without a driver. WALLY begins to dance in a crazy acrobatic style in perfect rhythm with the tune."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "FATS DOMINO (RADIO)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "WAH WAAAAAH WAH WAH WAAAAAH WAH..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY jumps out the passenger side and begins to dance as well. They exchange glances, dancing in unison, keeping pace with the cab."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "81.81."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MOSES looks left and right, roused by their energy. WALLY notices the gas station up ahead. None of its lights are on."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s closed!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "WALLY hops back into the cab. MARTY does the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(turning off radio)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I fucking told you we shoulda got gas before."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We’ll get it at the next town."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s like 20 minutes away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Shit...Just pull in."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The cab glides into the darkened station."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. SUNRAY GAS - SERVICE STATION"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A cinderblock smashes through a plate glass door."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. SUNWAY GAS - SERVICE STATION"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A hand flips a red toggle switch marked “PUMPS”."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. SUNRAY GAS - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The pump lights go on. WALLY is finishing counting their winnings in the cab."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to MOSES)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, now we’re fucking with our pants off."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY jogs over to the pump and begins to fuel."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "total."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to M OSES)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who’s a good boy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to WALLY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(MORE)(MORE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "82.82."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "His breathing’s better. We might not even need to give anything to the vet."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The sound of a roaring engine growing in the distance. MARTY and WALLY pause. Its gets louder and louder until a pick-up truck whizzes by the station. The men from Bowlero are packed into it and on the truck bed. ROGER makes eye-contact with MARTY as they pass. The driver jams on the brakes, causing it to skid."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Get in!! !!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY pulls the nozzle from the fuel tank but it’s too late -- the pick-up peels into the station. ROGER (a club in his hand), CLARK, TERRY, REDHEAD, etc. pile out. WALLY quickly locks the front and back driver’s side doors."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "REDHEAD"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, that’s him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Don’t gimme that. You’re Marty Mauser."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I have no idea what you’re talking about."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CLARK"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to WALLY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And lemme guess, you’re just giving him a ride?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m covering his gas money. He’s driving me-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, I’m a cab driver you dumbass."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CLARK"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(trying the locked door)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Get out of the car n*gg*r!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The following action happens in a flash: CLARK shoves his arm through the open window and grabs for WALLY’S throat. WALLY tries to fight him off with his left hand, while keeping the cash in his right hand as far away from the action as possibl e. The rest of the gang crowd in on MARTY."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "83.83."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He douses them all with gasoline. They fall over, gagging. ROGER smashes the back window with his club, reaches in and pries the cash from WALLY’s hand. MOSES bites ROGER, breaking skin. ROGER recoils, the cash falling to the backseat."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "WALLY turns the engine over. MARTY hops in the passenger seat. The cab fishtails out and smashes into a lamp post."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The passenger door flies open from the impact, fl inging MOSES and the cash out of the cab. The lamp post falls to the ground. The fixture explodes."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Wally! The dog!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(livid)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I TOLD YOU THIS WAS GONNA HAPPEN!! I’M FUCKED! I’M GONNA LOSE MY JOB, YOU UNDERSTAND THAT!!? UNLIKE YOU I NEED TO FUCKING WORK FOR A LIVING! I HAVE REAL RESPONSIBILITIES!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Through the back windshield, MARTY watches MOSES run onto a dirt field, getting smaller and smalle r until he’s swallowed by the darkness."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "[Cue Public Image Limited’s ‘The Order of Death’]"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. POTATO FIELD - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MOSES runs like mad, breathing hard, tongue flapping, kicking up clouds of dust in the moonlight. We punch into his eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "PUBLIC IMAGE LIMITED [SOUNDTRACK] This is what you want, this is what you get...This is what you want, this is what you get..."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. LAWRENCE’S - 53RD AND BROADWAY - AFTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The damaged cab pulls up in front of Lawrence’s. MARTY gets out."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m really sorry-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Close the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "WALLY angrily drives off. A beat. MARTY enters the building."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "84.84."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. LAWRENCE'S PING PONG PARLOR - STAIRCASE - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Track with MARTY up a flight of narrow stairs and into the parlor."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. LAWRENCE'S PING PONG PARLOR - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The place is packed, smoky, teaming with misfits, young and old. MARTY is greeted with stares of shocked recognition -- no one here has seen him since his loss in England. MARTY gives courtesy smiles, trying to maintain his dignity, as he approaches the cage."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MAN IN CAGE"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(looking up, realizing it’s MARTY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Marty!!! How you doing, man? I’m so sorry about London."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s alright. Lawrence around?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MAN IN CAGE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I think he’s in the back."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY heads towards the back of the parlor, greeted with more stares and glances. He spies LAWRENCE at a table giving training lessons, wielding a straightened coat hanger with a ping pong ball affixed to the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LAWRENCE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Marty! One second."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to trainee)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Topspin. You’re hitting it across the head. Just a swipe."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You think I can crash here tonight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LAWRENCE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Listen, there’s a lady waiting for you-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What? Who?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "85.85."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LAWRENCE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "She’s pregnant. Very upset. I told her she can wait in my office."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY rushes through the parlor to the office."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "[End of Public Image Limited cue]"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. BACK OFFICE - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY enters. RACHEL jumps up from a chair. She’s got a suitcase by her feet and a black eye."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m sorry...I didn’t want to...I don’t wanna bother you-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What the hell happened to your eye?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I- I had nowher e else to go. He just started yelling, and pushing me, he grabbed my shirt. There was nothing I-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Calm down. It’s ok. You’re ok."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She rushes into his arms and buries her face in his shoulder."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fucking animal."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MAUSER APARTMENT - MARTY’S ROOM - AFTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY quietly raises the window and enters his bedroom from the fire-escape. He notices his MOM sleeping in his bed -- on top of the blanket in a fetal position. He quietly opens his closet and removes a suit and his suitcase. He then grabs a table tennis trophy off a shelf, holding the brass figurine like a handle, and exits the room."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MAUSER APARTMENT - MAIN ROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He moves through the apartment."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM (O.S.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(softly)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "86.86."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY picks up his pace and leaves through the front door."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. TENEMENT BUILDING - HALLWAY AND STAIRS - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY walks down a flight of stairs, puts his luggage down, and pounds on a door."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "IRA (O.S.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(muffled)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Rachel?...Rachel, answer the door..."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ira. Open up. It’s Marty."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A pause. IRA opens the door. MARTY immediately bashes his face with the base of the trophy, sending him to the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "M ARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Shame on you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY exits the apartment and heads down the stairs."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. SUBWAY CAR - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY and RACHEL are seated together in a sparsely populated train car. Each with luggage by their side. He’s got his arm around her, her head in his lap."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. DION’S APARTMENT - PETER COOPER VILLAGE - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "DION opens the front door. MARTY enters with RACHEL. DION is immediately thrown by her presence."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "T hanks, Dion. I really appreciate this. This is my sister Rachel by the way. Rachel this is my buddy and business partner Dion."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL nods to DION."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, hi."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Her place got flooded and she needs to crash here just for the night, that’s ok, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "87.87."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Um..."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I can’t have her exposed to mold and spores. She’s not gonna get in the way of our work, don’t worry."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m not supposed to have people over."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Dee, come on. She’s eight months pregnant."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A long pause."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok, fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "They follow DION into the apartment."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You just gotta be outta here before my parents get back from Florida."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No problem...We should really take advantage of t his time we have together, really firm up our business plan. That way when your father gets back he’ll see how organized we are."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t know. He’s pretty upset. You left us with all this inventory for 8 months."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s fine. In a few weeks, I’m gonna take the Championship and we’ll be right back on track."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The balls are in here."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He opens the door to a small room. They enter."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "88.88."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. BEDROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A dozen cardboard boxes branded with ‘HALEX’ stamps are stacked against the wall."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This is them? Oh my god."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL takes a seat on a bed while MARTY excitedly opens up a box. Inside of it are hundreds of orange Marty Supreme balls."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You did the orange!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, I was able to find someone who could color the celluloid for-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Money. That’s why my dad is so mad. We’re invested in you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Check it out, Rachel."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He hands a ball to her."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hang on, I did a mock-up of the packaging too."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "DION grabs a rectangular box from the desk. It has a pen- drawn portrait of Marty on the left, and immaculate hand- lettering on the right: MARTY SUPREME -- THE OFFICIAL MARTY MAUSER CHAMPIONSHIP TABLE TENNIS BALL. ORANGE SPHERES - NEVER WEAR BLACK AGAIN."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Orange spheres ...you came up with that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, pretty good, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Good? Dion, I don’t even think you realize what you’re capable of. And you drew this? It’s absolutely stunning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "89.89."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s inspired."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to RACHEL)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Incredible, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL spins the ball in her hand to the Marty Supreme logo."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(flatly)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, it’s really nice."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "So this is your room?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nah, it’s my younger brother’s. He moved out-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "So it’s free then. Lemme get my sister situated, I’ll be out in a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "DION pauses and exits."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Special guy. You might not know it by looking at him."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL s its down on the bed. A pause. MARTY sits next to her."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This feels pretty comfortable."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "So you’re gonna go out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah. I really need to get my head together, make a plan for tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "A plan for what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t know. There’s a rich guy who offered me a job. I should hit him up."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What kind of job?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "90.90."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Doesn’t matter. Just to get to Japan."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nah, you get some rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY walks to the door. Hesitates a beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You need anything? You hungry?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re ok, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m ok."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY exits. Hold on RACHEL."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. DION’S APARTMENT - LIVING ROOM - MORNING"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY has the telephone receiver pressed to his ear."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RECEPTIONIST (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Good morning, Rockwell Ink."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Y es, Milton Rockwell please."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RECEPTIONIST (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s not in, can I take a message?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, do you know when you’re expecting him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "DION interrupts with a plate of bacon and eggs in his hand, places it in front of MARTY."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RECEPTIONIST (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s working off site today. Again, can I take a message?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "91.91."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to DION)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Make something for my sister too, for when she wakes up."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(into phone)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m sorry. Off site where?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RECEPTIONIST (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(growing annoyed)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Would you like to leave a message or not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well, I’m a friend of his- I fought in his son’s battalion. I was supposed to have breakfast with him this morning but I messed up and overslept."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. THEATER DISTRICT - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY walks down 45th street towar ds the Morosco Theater."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RECEPTIONIST (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I see."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, I have some of his letters and personal belongings. I’m only in town for the day. I guess I can always mail ‘em-"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He tries the main doors. They’re locked."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RECEPTIONIST (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No, no, wait. Try giving a call over to the Morosco Theater. He should be there until noon."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A worker exits through a nearby service door wheeling a dolly. MARTY catches the door before it closes and enters."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MOROSCO THEATER - HALLWAY - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY walks down a long rugged hallway -- scuffed concrete floors, brick walls, dim fluorescent light -- and through a door on his right."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "92.92."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MOROSCO THEATER - BACKSTAGE - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY enters the backstage area. The light is dim. The area is lined with lighting equipment, props and set pieces. A stagehand turns to look at him. MARTY sends him a confident nod."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He continues past an elaborate rigging system and finds himself in the wings, stage right. Immediately, he sees KAY performing on stage, wearing a brown wig. MARTY looks out to the mostly-empty theater. The first few rows are occupied by key personnel -- the DIRECTOR, the PUBLICIST, etc. MILTON is not among them."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY turns his attention to the rehearsal. The scene is set in a restaurant kitchen. A MOTHER [played by Kay] is quarreling with her teenage SON. The argument grows heated. A SUITOR [50s] enters from the opposite wing. The SUITOR slaps the SON across th e face. The SON grabs a knife and stabs the SUITOR. MOTHER screams. SON tries to escape through a backdoor but the door won’t budge. NOTE: the actor playing ‘SON’ is named TROY."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TROY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(breaking character)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s locked!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DIRECTOR"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, for crying out loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TROY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You gotta be kidding me!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DIRECTOR"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s fine. Will someone run around and see what’s going on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY continues to watch KAY closely."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TROY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to KAY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I was really feeling it too."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Actually, you were stepping all over me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TROY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Was I? I thought we had a good rhythm going."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s like watching someone jerk off with no lubricant."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(MORE)(MORE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "93.93."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (CONT'D)KAY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(snapping fingers)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Glenn! Can we do something about this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DIRECTOR"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We’re working on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(pointing to TROY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No, I mean this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DIRECTOR"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Let’s all take 5. Troy, go get your script, I want to see what you have scribbled on there."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY storms to the side of the stage and snatches her show book and reading glasses from her ASSISTANT. She sits down on folding chair -- just a few feet from MARTY -- and begins angrily reviewing pages."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to ASSISTANT)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "See? He jumped this line and this line."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY approaches."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey... Kay."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY looks up from her book, blankly."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s me. Marty Mauser...We met in London."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, I got a friend in the stagehand’s union. I was just dropping something off for him and-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You watched that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, I hope that’s ok...I can’t believe you’re acti ng again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "94.94."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, that wasn’t acting. I wasn’t allowed to act."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, that looked frustrating for you. What’s the deal with that guy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh don’t get me started."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You were running circles around him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Stays up 3 days in a row cause his character is supposed to be tired. It’s obnoxious."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "If he’s so committed, why didn’t he just punch his hand through the screen and unlock it from the other side? Why’d he stop the scene?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY listens intently."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s what I would have done."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(calling out)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Glenn!...GLENN!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "GLENN, in the midst of talking to TROY, looks over."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We need to talk."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GLENN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What what?! He’s ruining the scene."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GLENN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Kay, please. Let’s not over-react."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(gesturing at MARTY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This kid understands the part better than he does."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "95.95."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TROY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Excuse me!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GLENN"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to TROY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "One second."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to MARTY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Tell him what you just told me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nah. I was only-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No tell him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to TROY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well, I was just saying you didn’t really seem like you were that in it is all."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GLENN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s nobody. That’s the point."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Also, come on, only little kids hold a knife like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY crosses to the table, picks up the prop knife."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to TROY, demo nstrating)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "See how my wrist is square to the blade? The way you’re doing it-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TROY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s not a street fight."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well, ok, if you're going for phony at least do it with some flair. Like this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY lays the knife down across a fork. In one motion, he bangs on the prongs of the fork, vaults the knife into the air, catches it and lunges at TROY, the fake blade retracting into his neck."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "96.96."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TROY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "HEY! CUT IT OUT!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY looks over to KAY, who barks out a mean laugh."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GLENN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok that’s enough. Thank you for the tutorial."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Over GLENN’s shoulder, MARTY notices MILTON and the show’s PRODUCTION MANAGER walking past a door by the side of the stage."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GLENN (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I think we can continue without you now."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No sweat. I was just leaving."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY turns to KAY..."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Best of luck."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "...and hurries through the s ide door after MILTON. KAY stares after him."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MOROSCO THEATER - AUDITORIUM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY follows MILTON and the PRODUCTION MANAGER down a long hallway."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "-it’s a story about poor people yet somehow every set has to cost grand!? Explain that."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PRODUCTION MANAGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Kay approves all the-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "At this rate, the show could sell out every night and still lose money."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PRODUCTION MANAGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "She keeps sa ying “spare no expense”-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And your job is to say no."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY catches up, waits for an opportunity to interrupt."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "97.97."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PRODUCTION MANAGER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I do. But then she goes directly to each department-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, if you can’t manage her I’ll find someone else who can. Understood?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, Mr. Rockwell."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON turns around, shocked at the sight of him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I was hoping to get a word-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Did you call my office and tell them you were friends with my son?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, yes, but-"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON angrily storms toward s the exit."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Wait. Hang on!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON exits the theater, where a chauffeured Cadillac awaits him by the curb. MARTY follows him out."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. MOROSCO THEATER - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mr. Rockwell! Hold up. Can we just talk for a second?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We have nothing to talk about."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The chauffeur opens the car door for him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I want to revisit our conversation... about Japan."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(stopping)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh really?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "98.98."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes. I’ve reconsidered. I want to do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well that’s interesting. I seem to recall you having some concerns about your reputation."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No, I know. I consulted with my agent. He thinks it’s a good thing, that it’ll actually make my win at the Championship more dramatic."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He even scolded me, said I was being way too precious with myself. Anyway, my fee is 1,500 an d I’ll take you up on that flight you offered-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m about to start gagging on the bullshit."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m being completely straight-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I refuse to be a resource for you, Marty. The answer is no."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But why? You yourself said-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The event is next week. Other arrangements have been made. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON steps into the car. The chauffeur heads around to the driver’s side. MARTY raps his knuckle s on the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mr. Rockwell..."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(knock knock)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Please...."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(knock knock)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mr. Rockwell..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "99.99."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(voice muffled through the glass)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, let’s be pragmatists for a second. Put your personal feelings about me aside. You and I both know the kind of value I’d bring to an event with Endo on his home turf. You said so yourself. I’m like a stick of dynamite over there. Whatever other plans you’ve made, they’re going to pale in comparison..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A pause."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can we just sit and talk about this reasonably for 2 minutes? There’s more than enough common ground here."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Another pause."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fine, get in the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY runs around to the passenger side. MILTON motions to the driver and the car takes off. MARTY runs alongside it, banging on the window, until he can’t keep up."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "SON OF A BITCH! YOU WOULDN’T EVEN HAVE THE IDEA IF IT WASN’T FOR ME!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The car continues down t he street."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Hold a few beats on MARTY, stewing. He steps back on the curb and realizes that Kay’s ASSISTANT has been standing there, uncomfortable, waiting to speak with him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ASSISTANT"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Um, Ms. Stone would like to have lunch with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "100.100."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. EDISON HOTEL - BATHROOM - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY and KAY are having sex in the shower. She bites his tongue, holds it between her teeth. He turns her around, grabs hold of her shoulder and, using his other hand, delicately unclasps her expensive-looking necklace. It slides down the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. EDISON HOTEL - BEDROOM - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY gets dressed. MARTY, lying back on the bed, watches her."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "When can I see you again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No idea. We open Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I can just stay here and be on call."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(not amused)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "My husband leaves for Japan the morning after the opening. I should have more freedom then."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(carefully, testing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh yeah? What’s he doing there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No idea. We don’t talk."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(seeing time on clock)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Shit, I’m so late. And they’re going to have to redo my hair and makeup now too."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who cares? You’re the star. They work for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY continues dressing herself."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Gotta feel pretty great to be doing it again, no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I never should have stopped in the first place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "101.101."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why did you? Cuz of his money? I mean, you must’ve been doing pretty well for yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(tersely)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I wanted security. Then I got pregnant. And he pressured me. And I settled."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY fixes her makeup in the mirror."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well, you’re clearly making up for lost time now. Good for you. And it sounds to me like he’s paying you back with interest."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(sharply)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Your husband. He’s funding your whole show, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Where’d you get that idea?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I overheard him complaining about it in the lobby."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well he can go fuck himself."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Completely. What you should do is leach every penny out of him, assume your rightful place as the biggest star on the planet, and then rub it in his smug little face."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m not exactly looking for life advice from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "All I’m saying is you clearly never needed him in the first place...Now with me, I don’t want anyone’s help."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(MORE)(MORE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "102.102."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I have do it entirely on my own, purely on the basis of my talent, or else it’s like, the success won’t count."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s very easy to say."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It might be easy to say but it’s sure not easy to do. I mean, you know that. That’s why you cashed out."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY exhales sharply, offended."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Tell me, do you make money at this little table tennis thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Not yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "So then how do you live?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "With the co nfidence that if I believe in myself the money’s gonna follow. Ultimately, my struggle isn’t even about money."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But specifically, how do you pay rent?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re dodging the question."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m not sure what you’re-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How did you buy food today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Honestly? I was planning on ordering room service the second you leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "103.103."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Cute. And what happens if things don’t work out for you? What then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That doesn’t even enter my consciousness."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well maybe it should."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No offense but you’re starting to sound like my mom."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And you sound like a child."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh yeah? Clearly I’m old enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Meaning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m old enough to fuck you in a hotel room in the middle of your big comeback."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY exits the room, slamming the door behind her."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Break a leg."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Hold a beat on MARTY’s face."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. EDISON HOTEL - BATHROOM - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A hotel CUSTODIAN is using a plumber’s snake to dredge up the contents of the shower drain. MARTY stands in the doorframe, on the telephone."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(into phone)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s cause I was away, I only just received the letter yesterday....No, I understand..."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(MORE)(MORE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "104.104."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Just let Mr. Sethi know that a cashier’s check for the full amount of the fine is already in the mail...Of course, I just didn’t want anyone thinking that I wasn’t going to be in attendance, I will be at the Championship!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The CUSTODIAN pulls a massive clump of stagnant hair from the drain, KAY’s necklace dangling from the end of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(into phone)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hang on."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to CUSTODIAN)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yesssss!!!!! If my wife wa s here right now she’d be kissing you all over."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CUSTODIAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, what she look like?"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. UNCLE SAM’S PAWN SHOP - MIDTOWN - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "C.U. of necklace through a loupe. The PROPRIETOR examines it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PROPRIETOR"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This isn’t real."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Not real? It belongs to a millionaire. I watched it come off her neck."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PROPRIETOR"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t care where it came from. It’s garbage. Costume jewelry."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Costume jewelry?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PROPRIETOR"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ ll give you 2 bucks for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "FUCK!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Slow zoom into MARTY as he buries his head in his hands. The sound of a telephone ringing through a receiver rises on the soundtrack."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "105.105."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Dee, it’s me-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(angry)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Where have you been!?! The plan was for us to make a list of distributors, my dad lands tonight!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok, ok, you’re right. I’m heading back now to give you my undivided attention. Lemme just talk to my sister for a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. CRANBURY NEW JERSEY - LATE AFTEROON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY drives the Galanis’ Kaiser on a rural road flanked by farmland, RACHEL in the pas senger seat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hang on....RACHEL! MARTY’S ON THE PHONE!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A pause."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hi."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(all business)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Listen, there’s a dog collar in my jacket pocket, go grab it. I know a guy who lost a dog out in Jersey. He’ll pay a big reward."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, ok."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Also, there’s a set of car keys in a bowl on the telephone table by the front door. You see em?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "SUNRAY GAS becomes visible u p ahead. An “OUT OF SERVICE” sign hangs on the pump."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh...yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "106.106."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Take the keys and meet me downstairs in the garage. And make sure Dion doesn’t see you do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hang on...Hey Dion, would you mind going down to the store and getting me some ginger? I’m having really bad morning sickness."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(barely audible, standing far from the phone)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Isn’t it the afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY pulls the car into the gas station. RACHEL gets out with MOSES’ dog co llar in hand and walks towards the service station. An ATTENDANT comes out."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ATTENDANT"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sorry, station’s closed."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, I’m not looking for service. Did you happen to see a stray dog running around here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ATTENDANT"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nah, sorry. When you lose it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, a few days ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ATTENDANT"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Maybe try the pound."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You kidding, I’ve called every shelter in a 15 mile radius."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ATTENDANT"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sorry, can’t help you."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACH EL walks back to the car and gets in."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. KAISER - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’d he say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "107.107."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY notices a shitty clapboard house situated on a plot of farmland in the distance -- the only visible house in the area."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Let’s try that place."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. HOFF’S FARM - CRANBURY - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The car drives drives down a long gravel driveway towards the house. MARTY hops out of the car, steps up on a rotting porch and knocks. No answer. A dog starts barking from inside. He knocks again. The barking contin ues. A beat. MARTY steps off the porch and calls out to RACHEL."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ll be right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY follows the barking to the back of the house. He stops in front of a small window and peers inside. MARTY immediately sees MOSES. He taps on the glass. MOSES runs up to the window, barking aggressively."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. KAISER - SAME TIME"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL is cruising the radio dial when she sees MARTY walking towards her. MARTY s tops by the passenger side window."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s here."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, wow. Great."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, I’m gonna break into the house and grab him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Are you sure? Why don’t we just wait for someone to come home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That could be hours! We gotta return the car. Just keep your eyes trained on the road. If you see someone pull in, give two quick honks. Got it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, ok."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "108.108."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Tracking shot with MARTY as he trots to the side of the house. He walks onto a side porch and tries the screen door. It’s locked. MARTY looks around, punches his hand through the screen, unlatches it from the inside, and enters."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. HOFF’S HOUSE - KITCHEN - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY enters into a dining room. The place is disgusting - a rundown hoarder’s hell. MOSES runs into the room and barks."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Her e boy. Come...Moses, come."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MOSES continues to bark angrily. MARTY approaches cautiously."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Calm down. It’s ok. I’m gonna take you home."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "There’s no collar, no way to grab him. MOSES growls as he gets closer, then lunges to bite. MARTY whips his hand back just in time to avoid getting bitten."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh come on."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. KAISER - SAME TIME"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A beat-up pick-up truck pulls into the drive way. RACHEL immediat ely honks the horn several times. HOFF [60s, bedraggled, dirty clothes] pulls up behind her -- blocking the Kaiser in -- and steps out, confused to see a fancy car and a woman on his property. RACHEL leans out the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hello sir. Sorry to bother you, we’re looking for a lost dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "HOFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh yeah?"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. HOFF’S FARM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY runs over from the back of the property, smiling."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ah, hey! I’m so glad you’re back. I think you found my dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "HOFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re trespassing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "109.109."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, sorry about that. We lost him yesterday, been looking everywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "HOFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I got no idea what you’re talking about."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The dog that you found. It’s mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "HOFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I didn’t find any dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, you sure about that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "HOFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, I’m sure. Are you sure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Pause."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Thing is, I know for a fact you have the dog I’m looking for. I looked in your window."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "HOFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You were looking in my window?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s kind of a good thing I did, no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "HOFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s my dog of 8 years."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "There’s no way that’s true."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "HOFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Get the hell off my property before I call the police."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m the one who should be calling the police."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "HOFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What, you wanna see him up close?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "110.110."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes, I do actually."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "HOFF steps onto the porch, enters the house. A beat. MARTY looks over to RACHEL and shrugs. HOFF returns with single barrel shotgun by his side."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "HOFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I see your k*ke nose peer through my window again, I’m shooting it off."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Are you serious!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "MARTY, GET IN THE CAR!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No! This is ridiculous. I’m not leaving without the dog!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "HOFF shoots the shotgun into the dirt."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RAC HEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(hitting the horn)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "MARTY! NOW!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "HOFF pulls another shell from his pocket."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "HOFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(starting to load it)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Like I said, next time it’s going to your face."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY lunges, grabbing the barrel of the shotgun with both hands. It’s hot. It burns."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ahhh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY won’t let go. They tussle. HOFF throws MARTY to the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. KAISER - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "In a panic, RACHEL slides to the driver’s seat, turns the engine and g uns it towards MARTY. She beelines towards the front of the house, barely in control of the car. She plows into HOFF. He rolls off the windshield, cracking it, and onto the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "111.111."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. HOFF’S FARM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The car crashes into the front porch, splintering stairs and knocking one of the support beams over. MARTY dashes into the passenger side of the car while a dazed HOFF scrambles for the shotgun."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. KAISER - CONTINIOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Go! Go! Hit the gas! Floor it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The car races down the driveway towards a cornfield. HOFF fires the shotgun, shattering the rear window. The car dr ives straight into the cornfield, stalks hammering against metal like a storm of green shrapnel."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL turns to MARTY and flashes a crazed, electric smile."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. USED CAR LOT - LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Night has fallen. MARTY and RACHEL are crammed in a telephone booth. RACHEL is dialing the number off the dog collar. A few rings and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hello."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hi, sorry but did you lose a dog named Moses?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (P HONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Cause I just found him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "For real? Where?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "In New Jersey."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Jersey?! How’d he get to Jersey?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No clue. My sister and I pulled over to this boarded-up gas station to switch seats and he was there in the parking lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "112.112."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How is he?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, he’s a sweetie."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How’s his breathing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fine I think. We’re trying to get him to eat. Does he have any favorite foods?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY grows impatient."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(whispering)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The money."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He likes corn on the cob. Gimme your address, I’ll come now."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well...That’s the thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A pause."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s just...in situations like this , it’s kind of customary to give the person a reward, no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, fine. How much you have in mind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL cups her hand over the receiver and turns to MARTY."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(whispering)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s too much."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(whispering)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The guy’s fucking loaded. Go on, say it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "113.113."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I was thinking 2000 dollars would be fair."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re joking, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, and I know this isn’t your problem, but I’m about to have a baby, and I got no husband, no job. I really have to look after myself right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY nods approvingly."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You realize I got the dog for free at the pound."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hmmm. That’s kinda the wrong way to think about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yea h? How’m I supposed to think about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well let’s just say I’m not calling about a dog. Let’s say I’m calling about your mother. And I’m a doctor telling you I need to do emergency surgery or she’s gonna die. Are you gonna refuse the surgery because you got your mother for free?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY rolls his eyes and throws his hands up at the sky."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s the stupidest fucking thing I ever he ard."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I guess you don’t know anything about love then."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A pause."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Forget it. Gimme your address. I’ll bring the cash right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "114.114."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sorry but no."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No! Again, it’s not your fault, you sound like a very nice person-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well I’m not a nice person!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "-but I’ve been ripped off in the past and I’m not about to let that happen again, so we’re gonna have to find a way to get me the money first."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Right. And how do you propose we do that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Easy, you put it in a knapsack, and then leave it with the lost and found at the-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Listen to me you fucking dumb bitch-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hang up. Just hang up."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (PHONE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "-you’re not getting a red fucking cent without me laying my eyes on him, you understand me!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fine. How bout I just donate him to medical science instead? How’d you like-"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY reaches over, disengages the call and then starts pacing around the car lot. RACH EL follows."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I should have known better. That was never going to work."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "115.115."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s not your fault. It was a terrible idea. It was moronic."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Calm down....What color is the dog?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(annoyed)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I dunno, brown. Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Cause my boss knows all the local breeders, and maybe we can get a similar one and the owner won’t be able to tell the difference-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s not going to be able to recognize his own dog?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well maybe not right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(supremely annoyed)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You realiz e I should be practicing my game right now, right?! Instead of making a mockery of my life in a used car lot making prank calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. DION’S APARTMENT - PETER COOPER VILLAGE - LATE NIGHT"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "C.U. of a deadbolt, sound of keys jingling, the bolt turns. MARTY and RACHEL quietly enter the apartment. They’re intercepted by DION."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(angry, whispering)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What are you doing!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sorry, we got held up-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Keep y our voice down. My parents are sleeping."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "They’re back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I told you that! Where’s dad’s car!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "116.116."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s in the garage. Look, I can explain-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to RACHEL)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You tricked me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No I didn’t-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You lying little- You sent me to the store-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I have no idea what you’re talking about!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to RACHEL)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "SHHHH!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "TELL HIM TO SHHH!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Keep your voices down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, it’s not her fault. Obviously, I told her to take the keys."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, well I was supposed to pick them up from the airport! I had t o pretend to be sick. They had to take a taxi-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Did he notice the car was missing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No, but-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(normal volume)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then maybe calm the hell down."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Lower your voice!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "117.117."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re the one making a scene."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DIO"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Gimme those!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "DION snatches the car keys from MARTY’s hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, I need to be honest with you. We got into a little fender bender-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s not a big deal. I’ll cover the damages."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How? When?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, let’s all get some rest. I’ll smooth everything out with your father over breakfast-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What!? You’re not staying here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "D ION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You need to go right now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s the middle of the night, Dion."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY stares at DION, who is unable to make eye contact."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can we just talk about this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m sorry. I- I can’t."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You can’t what, talk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "118.118."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to RACHEL)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Come. Get your things."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY and RACHEL walk into the bedroom..."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. BEDROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "...and start gathering their things. DION stands in the doorway, keeping watch."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You have any idea what I’ve been through today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I told you, I can’t talk to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Wow. Must be great, being born with a silver spoon in your mouth. Meanwhile, some of us have to actually go out and work for a living."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "DION silently stares at MARTY and RACHEL while they pack."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey, would you mind looking over at the wall or something? It’s creeping me out."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL bursts into tears."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Where we gonna go? We have nowhere to go."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "See what you’re doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to DION)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Throw a pregnant woman out on the street in the dead of night? Your brain is recording this right now, Dion. It’s gonna live on in your conscience."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL continues to sob hysterically. MARTY walks to the door..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "119.119."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can I have a moment with my sister please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Just keep her voice down."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m trying."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "...and closes it on DION. RACHEL immediately stops crying."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Seriously though, where are we gonna go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY notices that her black eye is now streaked and runny."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A pause. He grows deadly serious."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Marty?"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(beat)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re scaring me."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He runs his index finger along her cheek and then shows her the yellow and black makeup on the end of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I- I’m sorry, I- I can explain."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No. No talking."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s not my fault. I didn’t know what to do-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "See how calm I am? That’s not going to last. I need you to get out of here."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You don’t understand-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You realize this is exactly the kind of shit my mother pulls on me? I mean, how could you of all people do this to me!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "120.120."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL snaps."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(yelling)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How I could do this to you!?! How about what you’re doing to me, huh!?! Have you ever once-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "SHHHHH!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "SHUSH YOURSELF, YOU NARCISSISTIC PRICK!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "DION opens the door in a panic."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Quiet! You’re gonna wake my-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(yelling)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Enough with your fucking parents. Aren’t you like 30 years old?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to MARTY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You realize I’m due in 4 weeks?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to DION)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And it’s his baby!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "DION’S fat her calls from the other room."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS (O.S.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "DION?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Now look what you did!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh who the fuck cares? I’m leaving anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(calling out)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "UH, SORRY DAD. JUST GOT SOME FRIENDS OVER."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "GALANIS stomps down the hall and into the room."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’s going on here!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s not my fault! They won’t leave!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "121.121."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY adopts an incredibly friendly demeanor."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey, Mr. Galanis! Just picking up some Supreme samples for a meeting with Spalding first thing in the morning. Tell him Dee."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DION"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Jesus, speak up."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t care what he has to say. I want you out of my house!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hang on a sec-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Wasting my money, wasting my son’s time, taking advantage of him-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Taking advantage?! How? By gi ving him an amazing business opportunity?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "GALANIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You call this business!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes, I do as a matter of fact. You give Dion money, I give him meaning."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "DION finally loses it. He charges through the room, grabs a box of Marty Supreme balls and dumps it out the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. PETER COOPER VILLAGE - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Wide shot of Peter Cooper Village. A thousand ping pong balls rain down onto the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. PETER COOPER VILLAGE - ELEVATOR - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY and RACHEL ride the elevator down in silence. They reach the lobby and step out."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "122.122."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. PETER COOPER VILLAGE - LOBBY - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY walks ahead of her, then whips around."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I want to tell you something and it’s not intended to be mean."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(beat)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I have a purpose. You don’t. And if you think that’s some kind of blessing it’s not. It puts me at a huge life disadvantage. It means I have an obligation to see a very specific thing through...and with that obligation comes sacrifice."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(beat)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "My life is the product of the choices I’ve been forced to make to see this specific thing through. Yours is the result of, what?, just making it up as you go along? That’s how you are. It’s not how I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL nods, a hangdog expression on her face."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re responsible for the shitty choices you’ve made. You can’t pawn them off onto me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How much you make a year at the pet store?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, about twelve hundred dollars."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well in case you’ve forgotten, I have a week to make fifteen hundred dollars and that doesn’t even include airfare...I need to focus right now. I can’t have any distractions."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m really sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "123.123."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It goes without saying that I’m in no position to settle down. If you’re really serious about leaving your husband, I’m not gonna abandon you. We’ll do the research, find you a maternity home, they’ll take you in, take care of all the hospital shit, ensure the baby gets placed in a good family-"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL shakes her heard no."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(quietly)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Just go home, Rachel."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But...what a m I gonna say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY starts heading towards the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’ll figure it out. Seriously, go home."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY exits the building. Hold on RACHEL’s face."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. RACHEL’S APARTMENT - LOWER EAST SIDE - AFTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL enters her apartment. She crosses though the darkness to the bedroom, where she sees IRA asleep on the bed. She approaches, stands over him. His eyes closed. His face bruised and swollen."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ir a...Ira..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A pause."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ira. Wake up."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He opens his eyes, the rest of his body remaining entirely still."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "124.124."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s not your baby."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "IRA stares blankly."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "[Cue New Order’s 'Perfect Kiss’]"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. LAWRENCE’S PING PONG PARLOR - NIGHT"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY plays table tennis with great ferocity. SMASH after SMASH after SMASH."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. RACHEL’S APARTMENT - NIGHT"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "IRA is in a blind rage. He pulls down a shelf. Picks up a sewing machine, throws it, blowing a hole in the wall."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. LAWRENCE’S PING PONG PARLOR - NIGHT"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY -- drenched in sweat -- practices his defense with a series of relentless, almost mechanized undercuts. Camera zooms into an extreme close-up of his eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. RACHEL’S APARTMENT - DAWN"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "IRA rages, spewing invectives about Marty and Rachel. He dumps a dresser drawer full of women’s clothing onto a piece of open luggage on the bed. He slams the luggage shut and carries it to the front door to throw it into the hall . When he opens it, a group of concerned neighbors are waiting out in the hall, including JUDY and Marty’s MOM."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "IRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JUDY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(angry)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’s going on in here? Do we need to call the police?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "IRA notices MOM."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "IRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(yelling back into the apartment, sarcastic)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Rachel! Its your new mother-in-law."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to MOM)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Congratulations, Mrs. Mauser. You’re gonna be a grandmother."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "125.125."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(very confused)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "IRA tosses the luggage into the hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "IRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Here. She’s your problem now."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL rushes to the door, supremely embarrassed."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m sorry. We’ll keep it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MOM"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Do you need help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m fine. I promise."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL closes the door on her/them."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. LAWRENCE’S PING PONG PARLOR - DAWN"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "LAWRENCE says goodbye and leaves. Tracking shot with MARTY in profile as he moves to the cage and flips off the lights one at a time. The house goes dark. We continue to track with MARTY in silhouette as he makes his way to Lawrence’s office. He plops down on the couch and stares at a large cut-out standee of himself leaning against the wall behind Lawrence’s desk. It says, “Marty Mauser -- the pride of Lawrences”."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "[End of New Order cue]"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. SEWARD PARK - SOON AFTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL stands in the middle of the crowded park, waiting. She spots two men -- MISHKIN and MITCH -- approaching. MISHKIN has his arm in a cast and sling."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You Rachel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re Ezra?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Where is he?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Give me the money and then I’ll bring him out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "126.126."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m not starting with this again."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This is getting annoying. I can just walk away right now, you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Either you show me the dog or we’re going to have a problem-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Just so you know, I’m not alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes. I have people watching."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t give a shit who’s watching. You’re not getting a penny till I see my dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL pulls the collar from her bag and shows it to MISHKIN."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s literally across the street. Like I said, I’m just looking to be paid for my time and effort."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MISHKIN reaches into his breast pocket and pulls out an envelope. He opens it, exposing a stack of cash."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hang on."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "They follow her to a payphone. She drops a nickel in and dials. MISHKIN watches her closely."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "BARTENDER [PHONE] Blarney Stone."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hi, it’s me. BARTEND ER [PHONE] Who’s me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You can bring the dog out now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "127.127. BARTENDER [PHONE] Yeah, what happened? You said you’d be right back. The dog pissed all over the floor-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Great. Walk him outside, we’re ready. BARTENDER [PHONE] I’m working. I can’t just step-"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She hangs up."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok, look over there, to the Blarney Stone."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "They all look over to a bar across the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Give it a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A BARTENDER exits the bar with a German Shepherd on a leash. He looks to his left and right, clearly annoyed."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "There he is. He’ll hand you the dog once I call and say we’re all squared up."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fuck you."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MISHKIN storms off. MITCH follows."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey! HEY!... What about my money???"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL chases after them."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "GIMME MY MONEY!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "They ignore her, picking up speed."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "STOP!! THIEF!! THOSE TWO GUYS STOLE MY PURSE!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "People in the park turn their heads."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "SOMEB ODY! HELP ME!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "128.128."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A concerned BYSTANDER gets in MISHKIN’s way."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "BYSTANDER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Stop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MISHKIN steamrolls past him. The BYSTANDER grabs MITCH and throws him to the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MITCH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "HEY!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The BYSTANDER presses his knee against MITCH’s chest."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MITCH (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "GET THE HELL OFFA ME!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "BYSTANDER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You wanna steal from a pregnant woman, huh?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MITCH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "She’s lying! She took my friend’s dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "BYSTANDER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "SOMEONE CALL THE POLICE!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL stands frozen. A concerned cit izen runs to the payphone. She sees MISHKIN nearing the edge of the park, almost at the dog. She turns around, heading off in the opposite direction."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "BYSTANDER (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Lady! It’s ok, come back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MITCH pulls out a gun. The BYSTANDER immediately backs away. MITCH gets up, catches up with RACHEL. He grabs her by the collar, ripping her dress, exposing her pregnant belly. BYSTANDERS pause in fear, MITCH points his gun in their direction."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MITCH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Stay back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. EDGE OF PARK - SAME TIME"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Tracking shot with MISHKIN as he races towards MOSES. The BARTENDER, seeing his angry expression, backs up."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "BARTENDER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Whoa whoah-"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MISHKIN realizes immediately that the dog is not MOSES."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "129.129."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What the fuck is this?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He grabs the BARTENDER by the throat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Answer me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The BARTENDER drops the leash. The dog runs into traffic. The BARTENDER flails his arms, punches MISHKIN in the head. MISHKIN pulls out a knife and stabs him."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MOROSCO THEATER - DRESSING ROOM - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY is seated in front of her dressing room mirror signing thank you notes to cast and crew. There’s a knock at t he door."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes, what is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The door opens. It’s MARTY."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(coldly)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s 12:30. I was wondering if maybe you wanted to take lunch?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Out of the question, we open tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh. Well, I was hoping you could maybe steal away for an hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can I step in for a second then? I wanted to talk to you about something."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m very busy."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’ll just take a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "130.130."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY closes the door behind him. She’s annoyed. He grows visibly awkward."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Um....I feel kind of nervous talking about this-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(impatiently)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Alright..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He reaches into his pocket and pulls out the necklace."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I stole this from you, ok, and I want to return it."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Kay stares incredulously at the necklace."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "My plan was to sell it and never see you again...but I can’t stop thinking about you. And I can’t-"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY starts laughing snidely."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re aware that’s costume jewelry, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(feigning surprise)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Costume jewelry?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, from the production."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(closing eyes)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m such an idiot."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What happened to doing it all on your own, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "131.131."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(deliberately avoiding eye contact)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know. I’m completely full of shit. I was in a tight spot, and I needed some money, and it was wrong. I’m flat broke, I have the World Championship in a week, I have no way to get there, I got no resources, no options. I got no one looking out for me, Kay."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(beat)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Which isn’t your problem. Which is why I’m returning it."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You know what I think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Wh at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I think you came here looking for a hand out."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What? No!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Stop. I think you went to sell it and discovered it was junk. And now you’ve come here with some ridiculous strategy to get me to have some sympathy and open my wallet."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You think I would insult your intelligence like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re not gonna stop? You’re gonna keep going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Stop what? I’m just being myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re bein g yourself!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "132.132."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m telling you the truth. I stole from you and I feel bad about it-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re wasting your energy. I don’t care. I would've stolen from me too."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MERLE -- her publicist -- knocks and enters simultaneously."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MERLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Kay- Oh, I’m sorry, I’m interrupting something."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He was just leaving. This is Martin, my friend Carol’s son. This is Merle, my publicist."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MERLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hello."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Martin wants to be an actor. Unfor tunately he’s not very good."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MERLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to MARTY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well, Broadway needs ushers too."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’s going on with the seating?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MERLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s taken care of. Milton is sending all of his employees, it’s like a company mandate."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And that’s supposed to make me feel good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MERLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Honey, it’s going to be a full house. Isn’t that the point?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, full of boring morons."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MERLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well, no. Fred Astaire is coming. And you got-"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "133.133."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, I should get out of your hair."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Merle, make sure he has a seat for tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Really?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MERLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, you are in for such a treat, young man! When you see this lady perform, you’re gonna feel like you got your cock sucked off by an industrial vacuum cleaner."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY bursts out laughing."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Merle!"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MOROSCO THEATER - BOX OFFICE - SHOWTIME"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "C.U. an envelope labeled ‘Marty Mauser’ is passe d through the slot. He opens the envelope. Inside is a single ticket and a note that reads: “Marty, Meet me in Central Park, across Fifth Ave, at midnight. Kay”"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MOROSCO THEATER - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY is seated near the back of the house, amongst a group of ROCKWELL EMPLOYEES. Others in the section have taken note of FRED ASTAIRE, who is being led by an usher from a door by the side of the stage."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ROCK WELL EMPLOYEE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I wonder how much he got paid to attend."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY looks over, sees ASTAIRE, then notices MILTON walking right behind him. MARTY watches MILTON take his seat."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The lights begin to dim, the house quiets. The curtain rises on the front exterior of a weed-covered two-story frame house. The paint is peeling and faded, revealing the weather- beaten wood beneath. The porch is sagging under the we ight of time, and the railing is loose, with missing spindles. Silence, and then..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "134.134."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TROY (OFF STAGE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "TAKE YOUR STINKIN’ SEATS!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A chair comes flying onto the stage from a second story window, crashing to the floor and breaking. KAY comes running out onto the porch in a rage."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (FROM STAGE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Have you lost your damn mind!? We do not throw things in this house!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The audience applauds her entrance. KAY looks energized, alive. TROY appears on the 2nd floor balcony."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TROY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(dripping with sarc asm)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, I was just practicing my aim, mama. You always said I should shoot for the stars."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY watches, transfixed."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. CENTRAL PARK - JUST PAST MIDNIGHT"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Tracking shot. KAY approaches MARTY, who is waiting by a park bench. She pulls him by the hand to an archway tunnel, enveloping them in darkness. She kisses him, wrapping her tongue around his."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I have something for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY pulls an expensive diamond necklace out from her pocket."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Turn around."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’s this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY clasps the necklace around his neck."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Every year my husband gets me a piece of jewelry for our anniversary, from Van Cleef, Cartier...I have 25 of them, one for each year of misery."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY looks down at the diamonds glinting in the moonlight."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "135.135."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That should cover your trip and then some."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t know what to say."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Shut up. Wearing them makes me feel like shit."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY pushes her against the wall of the tunnel and starts kissing her lips, then down to her neck and upper chest. KAY looks over to her left and sees a man walking a dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(whispers)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Stop, stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. GREAT LAWN - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY and MARTY fall down onto the grass, kissing. She pushes MARTY’s head down between her legs, hiking up her skirt. MARTY starts rubbing the bridge of his nose against her. KAY grits her teeth. Her back arches. A PATROLMAN suddenly shines a flashlight over the field."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(whispering)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Shit shit shit."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(whispering)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Lay still. Don’t move."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The beam of light passes over them, MARTY’s face still pressed between her legs. The beam of light returns and ho lds on them."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PATROLMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "STAND UP!...I SEE YOU!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(whispering)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "On the count of 3, we get up and run."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I can’t do that-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PATROLMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I SAID STAND UP!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "136.136."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "1...2...3."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "They both spring up, MARTY pulls KAY by the hand. PATROLMAN blows his whistle. PATROLMAN 2 appears from the opposite direction and reaches them quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PATROLMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Put your hands where I can see ‘em."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh come on."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What??? No, no, no. We-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PATROLMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ma’am. Turn around."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY grows incredibly flustered, turns around."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s not what you think. She lost an earring in the grass."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "PATROLMAN 1 arrives."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Officer, he was just helping me find my earring. Maybe we can use your flashlight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PATROLMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I see two earrings in your ears."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No, no, not this one- There was another earring, from before."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This was another pair of earrings from earlier in the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PATROLMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Holy crap. I know you. You’re Kay Stone."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh my god. This is not happening."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PATROLMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know exactly who yo u are."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "PATROLMAN 2 puts MARTY in handcuffs."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "137.137."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh come on. Are you serious?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "PATROLMAN 2 takes out another set of cuffs. KAY grows hysterical."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Please! Just let me go home. It’ll never happen again, I promise."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PATROLMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It doesn’t work that way, ma'am."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ll grab my wallet, and get you some cash. For putting you out."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Please Officer. She’s gonna go home and get you cash!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ll come right back. You have my word."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The PATROLMEN exchan ge glances."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PATROLMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to MARTY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You got ID?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "PATROLMAN 1 pats him down, notices the necklace."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PATROLMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh wow. Look at this. That’s a really nice necklace."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Take it! It’s yours!"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. FIFTH AVENUE - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY and MARTY rush down the block, the necklace no longer around his neck."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, do you think you can go grab me another necklace?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "138.138."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Are you serious? I can’t even believe this."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You said they mean nothing to you. It’ll just take you a couple minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ve been gone for more than half’n hour. I can’t go up and come right back down."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But you offered to do that for the cops."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "People are wondering where I’ve- My mother is up there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What if I come up and wait in the hall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Do not do that! You hear me?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(turning to r eflection)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Jesus, my hair."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hold on..."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(he smooths her hair, removes grass from it)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "There. You look fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(beat)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Please. You have 25 of ‘em."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Goddammit. Fine. Just wait here. Do not come up."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Tracking shot with KAY. She passes the entrance to the lobby and heads to the service entrance instead. A uniformed member of the the kitchen staff is having a cigarette out front."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Do not smoke in front of the building."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She enters."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "139.139."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. 870 FIFTH AVENUE - MOMENTS LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY passes through the staff quarters and into the party. The place is packed, filled with live music, loud drunken conversation, etc. MILTON approaches, annoyed."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Where on earth have you been? Everyone’s looking for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I was taking a moment for myself. I didn’t realize I needed a permission slip."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I put this whole thing on for you and you’re makin g me look like an idiot."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh gawd."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Merle is on the phone with the New York Times. A printer is going to read him the review."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "KAY spies MERLE across the room waving her over excitedly. Her whole face lights up. She runs across the room to him and presses her ear up to the phone receiver."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. 870 FIFTH AVENUE - AFTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY looks at his watch. KAY has not come down and he has grown impatient. He paces in front of the building. A pack of PARTYGOERS approach. MARTY blends in with them as they enter the lobby."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. 870 FIFTH AVENUE - 2ND FLOOR - MOMENTS LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY ascends a wide marble stairwell with the group. A large group of EXITING PARTYGOERS are coming down the stairs from the opposite direction."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "EXITING PARTYGOER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Party’s over."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "PARTYGOER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What?! We just got here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "140.140."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "EXITING PARTYGOER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We’re being asked to leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY worms his way past them, continuing up the stairs to the next landing."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The party is thinning out, people finding their coats, waiting to use the bathroom, etc. The whole vibe is muted, not festive."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY cautiously wanders down a hall. He passes a band packing up their instruments. He turns down another hallway, sees MILTON seated in a large den."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He avoids detection and takes the stairs another flight up."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. 870 FIFTH AVENUE - 3RD FLOOR - MOMENTS LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "At the next landing, he hears a muffled din of voices emanating from behind a closed door. He approaches and knocks. A high society WOMAN answers."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey, um, is Kay in there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WOMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This is not a good time."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can I just speak to her? Tell her-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WOMAN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I said this isn’t a good time."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She closes the door. MARTY arches his neck and catches a glimpse of KAY -- crying hysterically -- as the door shuts on him."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY stands in a state of utter desolation. Finally, he turns around, descends the stairs..."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. 870 FIFTH AVENUE - 2RD FLOOR - MOMENTS LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "...and walks into the den. MILTON is seated with a group of well-groomed middle aged men, conversing, eating, drinking whiskey. The vibe is jocul ar, relaxed -- a stark contrast to the dour mood coating the rest of the apartment."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Excuse me."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON turns around."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "141.141."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh you gotta be kidding me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m sorry to disturb you-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How did you get in my house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(totally denuded)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Please give me another chance, Mr. Rockwell. I am on my hands and knees. I need a ride to Japan and I need 1500 dollars so that I can compete in the Championship. I need this job very badly. I am begging you. I will work for you. I will lose. I will work under you without any per sonal point of view apart from making your event a success."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON shakes his head."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We don’t get second chances in life, Marty. I offered you the job and you said no."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I was impulsive. I realize that."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And I copped an attitude with you. I was rude. And over-confident-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And it won’t happen again! Please just give me another chance, Mr. Rockwell."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What d o you guy’s think? Should I give the little shit another chance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "142.142."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "His friend’s look highly amused. MARTY gets down on his knees in total supplication."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Please! I’m throwing myself at your mercy. I am humbling myself-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re making me sick! Stand up."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY quickly gets up."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m begging you. I’ll do anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Anything!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok. Go to my study, two doors down on your right. There’s some promotional samples on my desk. Gra b the paddle."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. 870 FIFTH AVENUE - STUDY - MOMENTS LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY enters the study and heads to the desk. He picks up a sponge racket with the Rockwell Ink logo screen-printed on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "168A INT. 870 FIFTH AVENUE - DEN - MOMENTS LATER 168A"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY re-enters the den with the paddle. MILTON is now standing. The others look like they’re fighting to stifle laughter."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ah Marty, gimme the paddle."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY hands it t o him. MILTON examines it admiringly."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok, so here’s what I want you to do. I want you to bend over that chair and drop your pants."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The men laugh."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "143.143."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "For real?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’ve been a really a bad boy and now you’re going to get a spanking."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY looks at the other men, then to MILTON."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh come on."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You want to get to Japan don’t you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes but-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well, that’s what it’s going to take."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A beat. MARTY processes."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "So to be clear, you’re going to bring me to Japan and then compensate me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Correct. We leave from Laguardia at 8am."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, do I need a ticket?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s my plane."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And how do I know you’re going to honor this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You don’t. You have no power here."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY turns around, unbuckles his pants, peels back his underwear enough to expose his ass, then steadies himself by placing his palms against the wall."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok. I’m ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "144.144."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ll go first."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(losing his cool)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "First!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m kidding."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON winds up, playfully, prolonging the moment. MARTY braces himself. All the ‘fun’ suddenly drains from MILTON’s face."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This one’s for my son."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He strikes MARTY’s ass as hard as he possibly can."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. SUBWAY - AFTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A numb MARTY leans against the window of the subway car -- light flitting past him as he sinks deeper into d ejection."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. LAWRENCE’S PING PONG PARLOR - LATERN"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY enters the parlor and approaches LAWRENCE in the cage."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LAWRENCE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Marty! There’s a guy on 10 who’s looking for a lesson if you’re interested."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nah, I’m actually hoping I can take over the office and crash. I gotta flight in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LAWRENCE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Flight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, I take off for Japan at 8."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LAWRENCE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re going?! That’s fantastic!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MAR TY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "145.145."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LAWRENCE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You don’t seem excited?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No, it’s good. I’m good."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LAWRENCE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, by the way, Wally’s looking for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(lighting up)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY scans the room, sees WALLY playing near the back of the parlor. He’s suddenly interrupted by MISHKIN and MITCH."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(dead calm)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hey. How you doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY rolls with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh wow. It’s so nice to see you. You know, I’ve been trying to get in touch with you"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh yeah?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah. I was wondering how your dog’s doing. By the time I dropped him at the vet his breathing was a lot better."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How bout we just cut the bullshit."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What do you mean? I was honestly concerned."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Listen, I got your girl waiting downstairs in the car-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who?...Rachel?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "She says my dog’s out in Jersey and that you know the address."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "146.146."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Alright. I can explain."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You can do it on the ride out. We’re going. Now."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY, processing, looks over to WALLY, still playing."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Alright. Just gimme a second. I need to say a quick something to my friend."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(oddly calm)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sure, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, thanks. I’ll be right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, I’m not gonna be here."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’ll be down at the car, taking a hammer to your girl’s stomach."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A pause. WALLY happens to turn around, notices MARTY."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "WALLY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "YO! MOUSE!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY holds eye contact, gives him a half smile."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Come on. Let’s go."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MISHKIN and MITCH lead MARTY out of the parlor. WALLY watches them go, confused."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. NASH AMBASSADOR - CRANBURY, NJ - LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MISHKIN’s car drives along a dark rural road. REUBEN drives. MISHKIN sits in the passenger seat. MARTY and RACHE L exchange glances, crammed in the back with MITCH. RACHEL looks both frightened and ashamed. The mood in the car is quiet, tense. Noticing the gas station up ahead, MARTY leans up to the front."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "147.147."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok, that’s it. It’s gonna be the first left after the station."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The car drives past the gas station and turns down the private road to the farmhouse. It pulls up to THE house and stops. MISHKIN and MITCH get out of the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Come on. Let’s go."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY steps out."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Reuben, you wait in the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY and MISHKIN, MITCH head towards the house, leaving RACHEL inside with REUBEN."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "REUBEN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sit ti ght."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. HOFF’S FARM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Everything is quiet, no lights on. They step up onto the damaged porch."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Go on. Knock."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY steps forward and knocks on the door. Barking immediately becomes audible from inside the house. MISHKIN lights up."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That’s my dog!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "See? I told you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Knock louder."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY knocks again."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. NASH AMBASSADOR - CRANBURY, NJ - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL watches fr om the back seat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "REUBEN"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to himself)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I hate that fuckin’ mutt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "148.148."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. HOFF’S FARM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MISHKIN, agitated, rushes to the door and knocks himself."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "OPEN UP!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The barking gets louder. MITCH walks to a front window and peers into the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You see anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MITCH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nah."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A rifle shot suddenly shatters the glass, hitting MITCH in the face. MOSES starts barking like crazy. MARTY falls to the ground covering his head. MISHKIN pulls a gun from his belt and, crouching, pulls MITCH’s body away from the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "REUBEN!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "More rifle shots from inside the house. The front window of the Ambassador shatters. RACHEL screams."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MISHKIN stands next to the window, extending his arm and shooting blindly into it. A shot from inside blasts through the frame of the house, blowing a chunk out of the wood and striking MISHKIN in the chest."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY makes a run fo r the car. He opens the back passenger door. RACHEL is lying flat, her blouse shredded, shoulder stained red from a gnarly open wound. REUBEN is slumped at the wheel, choking on blood. She’s in shock, a crazed expression on her face."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(in a panic)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh my god, oh my god. Rachel, are you ok? Say something!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(gasping for air)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m bleeding, I’m bleeding."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s ok, it’s ok."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Go get the mo ney...It’s in his pocket."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "149.149."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(screaming)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "THE MONEY! IT’S IN HIS INSIDE POCKET!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY quickly darts back to the porch. The shooting has stopped. MISHKIN is flat on his back, lying in a pool of blood."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY starts rifling through MISHKIN’s pockets, turning them inside out. He pulls the envelope from MISHKIN’s coat pocket."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MISHKIN"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(softly)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Motherfucker."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY fans out the cash -- the majority of it is cut-out pages f rom a pornographic magazine."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He hears the sound of MOSES crying from inside the house. MARTY gets up and looks through the shattered window. He sees HOFF lying prostrate, with MOSES circling his body."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "HOFF (O.S.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(barely audible)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Help... me...."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY runs to the car and jumps in."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. NASH AMBASSADOR - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY turns the engine and pulls out. RACHEL’s breathing is short and labored."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You go t it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, all good. Just stay still, don’t talk."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You can go now. You can go on your trip."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You did amazing. You’re amazing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "150.150."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. BELLEVUE HOSPITAL - ER - LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "RACHEL is rushed on a gurney by a NURSE and an orderly. MARTY holds her hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NURSE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "When’s her due date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, 4 weeks I think-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(in a panic)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why!?! Is the baby ok!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NURSE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Everything is fine. Just relax."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to MARTY)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re the husband?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, I’m a friend."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "They reach a set of double doors."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NURSE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Okay. Time to say goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No! Don’t leave!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "They’re sayin g I can’t come-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NURSE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’ll be right outside."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "RACHEL"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(screaming)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "MARTY!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY lets go of her hand as she’s wheeled away. RACHEL begins to hyperventilate. MARTY watches her recede down the hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NURSE (O.S.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Deep breaths. Count to 4 on the way in, hold for 4..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Push-in on MARTY’s face."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "151.151."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. HANEDA AIRPORT - JAPAN - MORNING"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A private plane with the Rockwell Ink logo emblazoned on its side gleams on the tarmac — polished aluminum catching the morning light."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The plane door swings open. A stewardess, crisp in her uniform, leans out, her smile practiced and precise."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "STEWARDESS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Welcome to Japan, Mr. Rockwell."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON steps out first and descends the mobile staircase. Behind him emerge a se ries of Rockwell executives."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY appears next. He pauses at the top of the staircase, eyes wide. A smile spreads across his face — part awe, part disbelief."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Down below, a contingent of Japanese businessmen, aides and translators wait in neat formation, bowing as the Americans descend."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "They usher MARTY and the rest of the group to a convoy of sedans."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. JAPANESE COUNTRYSIDE - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The convoy drives through a rural area, about an hour outside of Tokyo. Modest wooden houses sit close to the road — sloped tile roofs, smoke drifting from low stone chimneys. A few villagers pause in doorways to watch the cars pass."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Americanized Japanese big-band music creeps into the soundtrack..."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. UENO PARK AMPHITHEATER - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "An 8-piece jazz band plays at the side of a clamshell in the Ueno Park Amphitheater."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "T he bleachers are packed with hundreds of Japanese spectators. Rockwell Ink banners and signage are strung everywhere, as well as giant murals of Koto Endo."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The perimeter of the venue is lined with booths handing out Rockwell t-shirts, novelty paddles, and offering demonstrations of the Rockwell Roller ballpoint pen."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "On the stage sits a single ping pong table. ENDO stands next to it, in the midst of having his picture taken with a Japanese teenager in front of a Rockwell Roller display."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "152.152."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A huge banner hanging over them reads, “WIN A POINT, WIN A PEN” -- in both Japanese and English."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A new challenger steps onto the stage. ENDO serves. The ball bounces off the opponent’s racket at a perplexing angle. Point lost. The crowd responds with a mixture of laughter and awe. A ballboy retrieves the ball. The challenger bows. The photographer takes their picture."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The next challenger approache s the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. UENO PARK AMPHITHEATER - LEFT OF STAGE"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY is 10th in line, a hat pulled down low over his brow to hide his identity. He looks towards the stage and watches another challenger lose a point."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "To his right he sees an entire section devoted to the press -- photographers, cameramen, reporters. Nearby, sits a large group of uniformed American G.I.s. A decorated U.S. GENERAL is speakin g with MILTON."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A humiliating mural of MARTY losing in London, his head in his hands, hangs nearby. MARTY stares at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A Japanese SHOW WORKER approaches and quietly addresses him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHOW WORKER"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(in broken English)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mr. Rockwell does not want to begin yet. He asks that you please go to the back of the line."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How much longer is this gonna be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHOW WORKER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mr. Rockwell says the back of the line."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "We track wit h MARTY to the end of a very long line of contestants. The line peters out by an alley of concession stands. He spies an official IATT booth, and then sees RAM SETHI carrying a plate of food to a nearby table."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. UENO PARK AMPHITHEATER - CONCESSION STANDS - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY approaches SETHI, now seated at a table with a group of IATT officials."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mr. Sethi."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "153.153."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "SETHI looks up, his expression hardening on sight."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s me. Marty."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(lifts hat up slightly to expose his face)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m so happy to see you here. I’m surprised actually."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(unmoved)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And why would that be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t know. I-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You realize we do have a tournament to promote."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Right, no, of course. That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(gingerly)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "So, uh, then you know of my involvement in today’s event?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(matt er of fact)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I do."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, great. Just so you know, I’m only doing this to pay off my fine. In fact, I was planning on coming to see you first thing tomorrow to do exactly that."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m happy to hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A beat. It’s hard to read SETHI’s disposition."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Listen, I owe you an apology."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "SETHI just stares."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I acted like a jackass in London. I realize that, it was wrong of me. You had every right to take offense."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "154.154."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "There is such a thing as a code of courtesy, Mr. Mauser."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know. It’s just...I don’t get government assistance like the other players. It’s every man for himself where I come from, and that does something to a person. It creates a whole mindset, it’s almost like I don’t have control-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m really not interested in excuses."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s not an excuse. My point is, I’m going to pay off my fi ne and proceed with a much better attitude. That’s a promise."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(beat)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "In fact, if you see me being rude up there today, just know, this all scripted, I’m gonna lose 21-14. It’s theater. So don’t judge. You’ll be seeing the real me, the polite me, next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(confused)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Next week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, at the Championship."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You’re not participating in the Championship."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I said you’re not compe ting this year."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, I’m confused. I’m going to have the money. That’s why I’m doing the event. Come, let’s go find Mr. Rockwell. You’ll hear it straight from his mouth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "155.155."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The tournament is less than two weeks away. The bracketing has already been set."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "So we’ll redo the bracketing. There’s plenty of time."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m not about to pull apart the entire schedule for the benefit of one entitled American."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(pleading)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mr. Sethi. Look at me. I’m here! I came all this way! I’m in Japan! I don’t think you realize how difficult that was."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You haven’t come far enou gh I’m afraid."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY cannot believe what he’s hearing."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You have wasted your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why are you doing this me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "SETHI looks over to his associates, then back."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Because I don’t like you."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. UENO PARK AMPHITHEATER - BY THE STAGE - AFTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY, lost in pensive thought, is now next in line. On the stage a challenger loses a point to ENDO and gets his picture taken."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "It’s now MART Y’s turn. He darts his eyes over to MILTON. MILTON nods."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY walks to the center of the stage and braces himself. Suddenly, he pulls off his hat and tosses it into the crowd."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "156.156."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "With big overblown gestures, he points to his image on the mural, and then to himself. Confusion begins to set in."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON scans the amphitheater, watching the public as they begin to recognize MARTY -- “Marty Mauser-san” “Sore ga Amerika chanpion desu”, etc. The ANNOUNCER introduces MARTY to the audience, who ‘ooos’ and ‘ahhs’. MARTY speaks into the microphone."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(melodramatically)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It is I, Mart y Mauser! I have travelled a great many miles to the land of Japan to challenge my nemesis Endo!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The ANNOUNCER translates for the audience. They go wild. Photographers rush forward. Flash bulbs go off. ENDO waits for the fervor to die down and then says something in Japanese to the ANNOUNCER."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’s he saying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He wants to remind you that you came here on your own volition. And that you are interrupting the event."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well tell him I’m not leaving until he plays me."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON smiles, enjoying the spectacle. The ANNOUNCER translates into the mic and confers with ENDO."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to MARTY, into mic)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He says he does not want to embarrass you any further."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh, I am beyond embarrassment."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(yelling to the crowd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Listen everyone! Your hero is a chicken!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY starts clucking like a ch icken, riling up the crowd. The ANNOUNCER communicates with ENDO."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Green Rev. (mm/dd/yy)Green Rev. (mm/dd/yy)  157.157."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And he’s a fraud too! Take his paddle away and you’d all be winning pens!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mr. Endo senshu agrees to the match, on the condition that the loser will kiss a pig in front of the entire audience."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(genuinely surprised)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "A pig?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY whips his head over to MILTON. MILTON sends him a shit- eating grin."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He says if you’re going to act like a pig, he will happily mate you wit h one."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY removes his jacket as the ANNOUNCER translates ENDO’s comments about the pig to the audience. The entire crowd bursts into uproarious laughter."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. UENO PARK AMPHITHEATER - LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A pack of kids rush through the concession booths and into the amphitheater, where MARTY and ENDO are battling on the stage. The place is packed. Spirits are high."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO is up 19 - 14."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO serves. MARTY counter s with a short return. ENDO rushes forward nearly hitting the table, pushing the ball back over the net. MARTY feigns getting his foot caught in a mic cable on the floor and loses the point."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(acting the heel)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who put this chord in the way, huh!?! I could have broken my ankle! Move this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON is taking great pleasure in MARTY’s performance. The scoreboard switches to 20 - 14. Game point."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO serves with as much spin as he can muster. MARTY counters with a swooping undercut."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "158.158."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The ball sails over the net by just a few centimeters. The entire crowd “oooh’s.” They rally back and forth. ENDO goads MARTY into a smash by lobbing the ball high. MARTY swings hard, overshoots, and misses the table by a foot."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The crowd jumps up onto their feet, erupting in applause. MILTON stands up and joins them. The G.I.s clap politely, unenthused. Press rush onto the stage for photographs."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Th e ANNOUNCER declares ENDO the winner of the game and launches into a speech. The audience cheers loudly. MARTY approaches a SHOW WORKER who speaks English."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to SHOW WORKER)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What’s he saying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHOW WORKER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He’s giving cheers to our champion."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The ANNOUNCER keeps speaking."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHOW WORKER (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Now he is calling to the stage a special guest."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ANNOUNCER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ra-mu Se-ti kaitcho desu!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHOW WORKER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Mr. Ram Sethi."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY watc hes SETHI enter from the side of the stage and take the microphone."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(in slow English)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Good afternoon Tokyo. And thank you Mr. Rockwell for hosting such a fabulous event."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON smiles and waves."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Let’s all give Mr. Endo another warm round of applause for allowing us all to observe his brilliance."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The ANNOUNCER quickly translates for the audience. The audience applauds."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "159.159."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Today’s event is but a taste of what’s to come at next week’s World Championship, where some of the world’s finest athletes will be competing against your home town hero, Koto Endo-san."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The ANNOUNCER translates. MARTY looks to ENDO, then to MILTON."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SETHI (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But let’s not delay the ceremony any further. It’s time to bring on Agu the pig and watch the American plant a kiss on him."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "After a small dru m roll, two farmers wheel out an enormous pig on a rolling platform. The crowd roars in delight. MARTY takes it all in, the tension on his face coiling tighter with every passing second, until..."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "WAIT...WAIT...WAIT..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The ANNOUNCER pauses."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Tell Endo we should play a real game! Go ahead. Tell him I want to play a game that isn’t a sham."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO looks to the ANNOUNCER, who refuses to translate, then to MILTON, who looks supremely annoyed."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(turning to SHOW WORKER)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You! Tell the audience that that was staged. That I want to play him in a real game. Go, translate that."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The G.I.s near the front of the stage listen with interest. MILTON confers angrily with his executives."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHOW WORKER"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m sorry, I cannot do that for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY turns directly to the audience."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(yelling)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That entire game was staged! It was fake! A fake game!"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(MORE)(MORE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "160.160."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Neither of us were playing to the best of our abilities! Who wants to see us play a real game!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(slowly)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "A... REAL... GAME..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "One of Milton’s EXECUTIVES approaches the base of the stage."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "EXECUTIVE"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(loudly)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok, that’s enough. There’re a lot of people here that would still like a turn for a pen."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to ANNOUNCER)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Let’s move on. Someone tell him to move the show on."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "An English-speaking Japanese man in the au dience stands up and translates loudly for the crowd. Outrage begins to spread. They begin to chant for a real game."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Meanwhile, MARTY turns to ENDO."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "C’mon, you’re gonna side with them? An American company selling their product on your back? Really? You want to be a mascot? We’re not mascots, we’re real athletes."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO can’t understand him. He beckons the SHOW WORKER over for translation. MARTY ke eps speaking, looking directly into ENDO’s eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, I’m not going to be competing in the Championship. This is it for me. Please. It’s a stupid pen event. It’s shameful for both of us. Let’s give it meaning. Let’s really play. Please."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "SHOW WORKER translates. The crowd continues to chant. ENDO and MARTY hold eye contact. ENDO acquiesces with a curt nod."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes? Yes. He says yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(turnin g to the crowd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "HE SAYS YES!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The crowd breaks into thunderous cheers. The ANNOUNCER turns towards MILTON, who has little choice but to reluctantly wave the game on."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Green Rev. (mm/dd/yy)Green Rev. (mm/dd/yy)  161.161."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY takes off his jacket. The scoreboard is reset to 0 - 0."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO picks up a ball and shuffles it in his hands under the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(pointing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Left."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO lifts up the ball in his right hand and throws it to MARTY."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No, no, no. I don’t want charity. Your serve."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO serves. A hard fought point that Endo wins. 1 - 0. The crowd goes wild. ENDO tries a chop serve. MARTY chops back. MARTY goes for a kill, misjudges his strength and loses the point. 2 - 0. Again, the crowd erupts. A group of uniformed cheerleaders perform an elaborate clapping cheer in unison."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO serves. MARTY pushes the serve back lightly. ENDO smashes to MARTY’s forehand. MARTY tires ENDO out and crosses for a winner. 2 - 1. The audience falls quiet, save for the G.I.s, who cheer."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO, upset with the loss, grows more foc used. He serves. MARTY employs a different tactic, instead of attacking, he slice-chops a long sailing return. ENDO smashes. Again MARTY sails the ball back over with a slice-chop. They trade slices until MARTY flips to an offensive turn and wins the point. 2 -"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The G.I.s jump to their feet hollering “LET’S GO MARTY!” MILTON does not look happy."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. UENO PARK AMPHITHEATER - LATER"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "It’s standing r oom only now, people packed into the amphitheater like canned sardines."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The score is 17 - 17."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO and MARTY are both drenched in sweat, stripped down to their undershirts. Tensions are high. MILTON watches with stoic intensity."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO serves. MARTY pushes the serve back lightly. ENDO smashes to MARTY’s forehand. MARTY takes a defensive approach, chopping and slicing, forcing ENDO into an error. He takes the point. 17 - 18. The crowd look dejected. MILTON gets up out of his seat."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "162.162."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO takes a moment to consult with his coach. MARTY pulls his shirt up to his face and towels off with it, then heads to the side of the stage for a glass of water."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON approaches him, squeezing past various attendants."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Excuse me. Sumimasen. Sumimasen."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You can save your breath. I already know I’m not getting paid."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes, win or lose, you get nothing. And you can forget about getti ng a ride home on my plane."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I’m not expecting a thing from you. So unless you’re planning on shutting down the event, we have nothing to discuss."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Oh yeah? It’s really that straightforward, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "To me it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You know Marty, this is all fabulous. And fantastically entertaining...But you and I made an agreement. We have a contract. And we sealed it with a paddle."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I really nee d to focus right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON looks MARTY right in the eye. He speaks at a casual pace but with searing intensity."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I have no interest in trying to control you. But it’s important that you know the stakes here. I was born in 1601. I’m a vampire. I've met a lot of Marty Mauser's over the centuries. Some of them crossed me. They weren't straight, they weren't honest. And those are the one's that are still here."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(MORE)(MORE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Green Rev. (mm/dd/yy)Green Rev. (mm/dd/yy)  163.163."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON (CONT'D)MILTON (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "They're not happy but they're still here. Do you understand what I'm saying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Marty remains quiet. The conversation seems to be taking place on some very fine-tuned existential plane."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MILTON (CONT'D)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Well you should really think about it. Cause if you win, you're going to be here forever too. And you won't be happy, Marty. You won't ever be happy."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The cheerleaders clap for ENDO to return to the table. MILTO N heads back to his seat."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The two players returns to the table and take a beat to center themselves. ENDO serves. They trade forehands. MARTY can’t keep up. He faults into the net. 18 - 18."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MILTON takes his seat as the crowd roars around him."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO serves to MARTY’s backhand. MARTY chop-slices the ball, floating long towards the back causing ENDO to do the same. ENDO attacks. MARTY lobs to ENDO who smashes. MARTY smashes a counter court shot back, winning the point. 18 - 19."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "There we go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO serves with an expression carved from stone, every motion measured. After a long rally, ENDO wins, tying the game at 19 - 19. The crowd explodes. SETHI, standing among them, smiles to himself."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "ENDO waits for the cheering to die before his next serve. They engage in a series of cross table shots. MA RTY has ENDO running back and forth, it seems as though MARTY is in complete control until he faults and goes down. The crowd jumps to their feet. 20 - 19. Game point!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The crowd begins to chant ENDO’s name. The synchronized clappers launch into a new cheer. MILTON just stares. ENDO serves. MARTY returns it with an offensive forehand. They trade forehands until one of ENDO’s shots hits the net - th e crowd gasps - the ball bounces short off the net and onto MARTY’s side of the table. MARTY dives, reaches the ball just before it hits the floor. The ball just makes it onto ENDO’s side and rolls out. MARTY’s point. 20 - 20."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY lets out a big scream and confidently runs his hands through his hair. The G.I.s let out a massive sigh of relief. The rest of the crowd falls silent."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "164.164."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The ANNOUNCER talks into the mic. The Rockwell EXECUTIVE translates for MILTON."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "EXECUTIVE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Gotta win by two."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Service changes to MARTY. After another drawn out point. MARTY is able to endure and win it. The G.I.s jump to their feet! It’s 20 - 21. Marty’s first game point. He collects the ball and takes a moment to breathe."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY looks to MILTON, then to SETHI. He approaches the table, readies himself . ENDO and MARTY exchange a long look."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY serves a very complicated spin. ENDO’s return looks long, but hits the end of the table, clipping it. MARTY is able to catch the ball and snake it back. It lands with such intense spin that it bounces in an unpredictable way. ENDO pushes the ball back lightly and the point regulates itself into a series of forehand and backhand chop exchanges. The two s tay lockstep in a defensive position. Who’s going to switch to offense first? MARTY makes his move and sends a forehand smash across the table. ENDO is just able to catch the ball, but places a perfect kill shot for MARTY. MARTY smashes."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY has won the game, 20 - 22. He drops to the floor and covers his eyes with his hands. The G.I.s go absolutely ape. MILTON sits still as stone, his eyes smold ering. The energy in the rest of the amphitheater has completely drained out, replaced by palpable silence. The crowd looks utterly disconsolate."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY stands up and approaches ENDO. ENDO puts out his hand, but MARTY pulls him in for a hug."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Great game. Thank you. Best of luck at the Championship. I hope you win."
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to ANNOUNCER)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Tell him I said best of luck at the Championship."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY, drenched i n sweat, out of breath, turns to face the crowd. His eyes slowly glaze over, as if his life’s dream is being washed off his face in real time."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The tinny buzz of an international ring tone rises on the soundtrack..."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "OPERATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Bellevue hospital."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "165.165."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Hi, yes. I’m looking to be connected with a patient, Rachel Mizler? She might have already been discharged."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "OPERATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Do you know what floor she’s on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Uh, she’d be in recovery, from surgery, wherever you keep patients like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "OPERATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Please hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "EXT. YOKOTA AIR BASE - AIRFIELD - NIGHT"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A U.S. Army jeep drives MARTY through a sprawling military base in the pouri ng rain. The jeep drives onto a tarmac, where a large transport aircraft is being readied for take- off."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "OPERATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Ok, it looks like she was was moved to the maternity floor last-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Maternity floor!?! She’s not due for weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY runs out of the jeep holding his luggage over his head to block the rain, and climbs onto the plane."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "OPERATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don’t know the details-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Is she ok!?! Did she have the baby!?"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. DC-4 AIRPLANE - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY steps aboard and takes a seat. The cabin is packed with uniformed soldiers and other military personnel. Spirits are extremely high -- these men are returning home after years of foreign service."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "OPERATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This is all the information that I have, that she was rushed to the-"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "166.166."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Rushed!?! I thought you said “moved”!?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "OPERATOR (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(tersely)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Will you calm down."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY (V.O.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Just put me through to the maternity ward please."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. STEWART AIR NATIONAL GUARD BASE - HUDSON, NY - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY walks briskly through the terminal, passing soldiers as they reunite with their wives and families."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. BELLEVUE HOSPITAL - MATERNITY WARD - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY runs out of the elevator and pa st the NURSE’s station."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NURSE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Excuse me, sir. You need to sign in-"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(not stopping)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It’s ok, I’m the father."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY rushes down the hallway, scanning the room numbers. In a waiting area down the hall he sees his MOM seated with members of Rachel’s family. They turn towards him, none of them looking happy to see him. MARTY gives MOM a curt nod and continues down the hall. He finds room 613 and bursts in."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MATERNITY WARD - ROOM 613 - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The room is crowded with beds occupied by women in postpartum recovery. He sees RACHEL -- sound asleep on the other side of the room -- and closes the door behind him. It’s an oddly anticlimactic moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He quietly approaches RACHEL’s bed. Her hair is a greasy tangled mess, dark circles under her eyes, her lower lip hanging slack. He gently cups his ha nds to her forehead, leans down and kisses it. She stirs ever-so-slightly, letting out a soft unintelligible mumble. Her eyes open..."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARTY"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Shhh...shhhh...Rest...I’m here. I’m not going anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "167.167."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "...and then close. MARTY stares down at her placid face."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene-heading",
      "text": "INT. MATERNITY WARD - NURSERY - SOON"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY approaches the nursery windows. He stops and scans the babies in their respective bassinets. He finds the one marked “Mizler”."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A NURSE is stationed on the other side of the glass. MARTY knocks on the window and points to the baby. She wheels the bassinet up close."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARTY stares at the baby. It stretche s one arm out as the opposite arm bends up at the elbow. It lets out a tiny, painless cry. MARTY suddenly bursts into tears, sobbing uncontrollably, like a dam has broken."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "[Cue Tears For Fears’'Everybody Wants to Rule The World’]"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "THE END"
    }
  ],
  "stacks": {},
  "lists": {
    "characters": [
      {
        "id": 1787456493052.701,
        "name": "MARTY",
        "color": "hsl(295, 70%, 60%)"
      },
      {
        "id": 1787456493053.1072,
        "name": "KAY",
        "color": "hsl(156, 70%, 60%)"
      },
      {
        "id": 1787456493052.1353,
        "name": "RACHEL",
        "color": "hsl(209, 70%, 60%)"
      },
      {
        "id": 1787456493053.6343,
        "name": "MILTON",
        "color": "hsl(72, 70%, 60%)"
      },
      {
        "id": 1787456493053.7031,
        "name": "MISHKIN",
        "color": "hsl(87, 70%, 60%)"
      },
      {
        "id": 1787456493052.6816,
        "name": "WALLY",
        "color": "hsl(119, 70%, 60%)"
      },
      {
        "id": 1787456493052.8435,
        "name": "DION",
        "color": "hsl(107, 70%, 60%)"
      },
      {
